re owned by a Hamas intelligence official, Saber Siyam.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'ISIS Allies Target Hamas and Energize Gaza Extremists ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'ISIS Allies Target Hamas and Energize Gaza Extremists ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Gaza Strip', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hamas', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Waheidi, Majd al', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bombs and Explosives', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Palestinians', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Rights Violations', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'International Crisis Group', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-01T00:19:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Diaa Hadid and Majd Al Waheidi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Diaa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hadid', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Majd', 'middlename': 'Al', 'lastname': 'Waheidi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/694f7d7c-304a-5370-aff0-731aa01213f0', 'word_count': 1241, 'uri': 'nyt://article/694f7d7c-304a-5370-aff0-731aa01213f0'}, {'abstract': 'As a vocal group rails against a nuclear deal, a seemingly larger group of Iranians long for a deal they say would help them and the country advance.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/01/world/middleeast/divide-on-iran-nuclear-deal-hard-liners-vs-invisible-people.html', 'snippet': 'As a vocal group rails against a nuclear deal, a seemingly larger group of Iranians long for a deal they say would help them and the country advance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TEHRAN — In the little shade provided by Tehran’s Freedom Tower, a group of about 200 Iranian hard-liners, some with hats made of folded newspapers to protect them against the sun’s rays, sat in the searing heat Tuesday on blue plastic chairs next to blaring loudspeakers.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/01/world/01iran-web/01iran-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/01/world/01iran-web/01iran-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/01/world/01iran-web/01iran-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/01/world/01iran-web/01iran-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/01/world/01iran-web/01iran-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/01/world/01iran-web