, was standing over him, with Sadat saying to Meir something like, “I want the trophy, I want the prize money, I want the belt.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/friedman-circular/friedman-circular-jumbo-v2.png', 'height': 228, 'width': 228, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/friedman-circular/friedman-circular-superJumbo-v2.png', 'height': 228, 'width': 228, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/friedman-circular/friedman-circular-thumbStandard-v2.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/friedman-circular/friedman-circular-thumbStandard-v2.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/friedman-circular/friedman-circular-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Good Bad Deal?', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Columnist', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Good Bad Deal?', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Friedman, Thomas L', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Weapons', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Khamenei, Ali', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_dat