nships.html', 'snippet': 'It’s not the long hours. It’s the scut work and heavy patient loads.', 'lead_paragraph': 'APPROXIMATELY 26,000 newly minted doctors across the United States will begin their internships today. For many, this legendarily grueling year will be the most trying time of their professional lives. Most will spend it in a state of perpetual exhaustion, as near ascetics with regard to family, friends and other pleasures. I was an intern nearly 20 years ago, but I still remember it the way soldiers remember war.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/03/16/opinion/Jauhar-Sandeep-circular/Jauhar-Sandeep-circular-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 300, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/03/16/opinion/Jauhar-Sandeep-circular/Jauhar-Sandeep-circular-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 300}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/03/16/opinion/Jauhar-Sandeep-circular/Jauhar-Sandeep-circular-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 800, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/03/16/opinion/Jauhar-Sandeep-circular/Jauhar-Sandeep-circular-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 800, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/03/16/opinion/Jauhar-Sandeep-circular/Jauhar-Sandeep-circular-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/03/16/opinion/Jauhar-Sandeep-circular/Jauhar-Sandeep-circular-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 