nto a bowl or sifted flour for a batch of chocolate chip cookies. Now, at 3, she is always eager to sift, dump, stir and cut (using this egg slicer and a blunt-nosed serrated knife).', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Kids in the Kitchen: Easy Sheet-Pan Chicken', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Kitchens', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recipes', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clark, Melissa', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-01T15:27:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Margaux Laskey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Margaux', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Laskey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f3475a99-68d7-592d-a04a-e05af11c7e0a', 'word_count': 915, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f3475a99-68d7-592d-a04a-e05af11c7e0a'}, {'abstract': 'Constant exposure to moderate levels of traffic noise may increase the risk for cardiovascular disease, a report in The European Heart Journal says.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/07/01/study-links-traffic-noise-and-cardiovascular-disease/', 'snippet': 'Constant exposure to moderate levels of traffic noise may increase the risk for cardiovascular disease, a report in The European Heart Journal says.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Continual exposure to traffic noise may increase the risk for cardiovascular disease, British researchers report.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption