ews', '_id': 'nyt://article/d7c7af54-d60c-521b-95b6-458261d28723', 'word_count': 1079, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d7c7af54-d60c-521b-95b6-458261d28723'}, {'abstract': 'In high-tech Chengdu, the old way of life persists, with graceful teahouses, serene parks and a lively Tibetan quarter.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/travel/100000003743398/36-hours-in-chengdu.html', 'snippet': 'In high-tech Chengdu, the old way of life persists, with graceful teahouses, serene parks and a lively Tibetan quarter.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In high-tech Chengdu, the old way of life persists, with graceful teahouses, serene parks and a lively Tibetan quarter.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/15/multimedia/36hours-chengdu/36hours-chengdu-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/15/multimedia/36hours-chengdu/36hours-chengdu-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/15/multimedia/36hours-chengdu/36hours-chengdu-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/15/multimedia/36hours-chengdu/36hours-chengdu-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1125, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/15/multimedia/36hours-chengdu/36hours-chengdu-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/15/multimedia/36hours-chengdu/36hours-chengdu-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/15/multimedia/36hours-chengdu/36hours-chengdu-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '36 Hours in Chengdu', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chengdu (China)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-01T17:28:25+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'Jonah M. Kessel, Max Duncan, Sarah Li, Will Lloyd and Dominic Yip', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jonah', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/43110544-59be-59fe-8621-093c0e9be493', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/43110544-59be-59fe-8621-093c0e9be493'}, {'abstract': 'Despite being a center of high-tech industry, the old way of life persists in the city, with graceful teahouses, serene parks and a lively Tibetan quarter.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/05/travel/what-to-do-in-36-hours-in-chengdu-china.html', 'snippet': 'Despite being a center of high-tech industry, the old way of life persists in the city, with graceful teahouses, serene parks and a lively Tibetan quarter.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Chengdu might look like a typically gray Chinese metropolis of skyscrapers and chaotic traffic, but beneath the concrete exterior is one of China’s most inviting, charming cities. Life moves just a little more slowly here. The teahouses fill up quickly on weekends with locals practicing calligraphy and cracking sunflower seeds, and at the Chengdu panda research center, the city’s most famous residents seem content lazing about in trees most of the time. Recently, though, this unpretentious city has seen its economy boom as one of China’s new high-tech hubs, luring young entrepreneurs to found creative start-ups and innovative architects to transform the skyline. There’s definitely a buzz about the place, though it’s hard to notice over the clacking of tiles during a rousing game of mah-jongg in the park.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '36 Hours in Chengdu, China', 'kicker': 'Weekend Guide', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '36 Hours in Chengdu, China', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bergman, Justin', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chengdu (China)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-01T17:30:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Justin Bergman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Justin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bergman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/af058dcb-fe23-5822-8d68-3749228fcbc8', 'word_count': 1422, 'uri': 'nyt://article/af058dcb-fe23-5822-8d68-3749228fcbc8'}, {'abstract': 'The singer, whose new album is “Communion,” is also a busy actor in film and television.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/05/arts/music/olly-alexander-releases-his-debut-album-with-years-years.html', 'snippet': 'The singer, whose new album is “Communion,” is also a busy actor in film and television.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Skinny and gap-toothed, with a mop of brown curls now cropped and bleached platinum, Olly Alexander has parlayed his unusual good looks and boyish R&B vibrato into a diverse career. This British actor and singer has appeared in television shows including Showtime’s “Penny Dreadful” and a bunch of indie films, and once played Peter Pan on the West End. Now his electro-pop trio, Years & Years, is set to release its debut full-length album, “Communion” (Interscope), on Friday, just five days before Mr. Alexander turns 25. The band plays “The Tonight Show Starring Jimmy Fallon” on July 16.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/05/arts/05SNAPSHOT/05SNAPSHOT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1098, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/05/arts/05SNAPSHOT/05SNAPSHOT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1098}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/05/arts/05SNAPSHOT/05SNAPSHOT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 560, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/05/arts/05SNAPSHOT/05SNAPSHOT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1541, 'width': 842, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/05/arts/05SNAPSHOT/05SNAPSHOT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/05/arts/05SNAPSHOT/05SNAPSHOT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/05/arts/05SNAPSHOT/05SNAPSHOT-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'wi