-offers-mix-of-banda-and-electronica.html', 'snippet': 'The annual event is devoted to slipping music from across Latin America (and Spain too) past the barriers of language and radio formats.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The annual Latin Alternative Music Conference is stubbornly devoted to slipping music from across the Americas (and Spain too) past the barriers of language and radio formats. Many of its headliners are repeat visitors, like the bilingual, quietly crafty Mexican indie-pop songwriter Ximena Sariñana, who shares a free showcase on Saturday afternoon at Central Park SummerStage with Vicentico, the Argentine rocker who founded Los Fabulosos Cadillacs in the 1980s and went solo in 2001. (3 p.m. Rumsey Playfield.)', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/05/arts/05GUIDE5/05GUIDE5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 971, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/05/arts/05GUIDE5/05GUIDE5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 971}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/05/arts/05GUIDE5/05GUIDE5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 634, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/05/arts/05GUIDE5/05GUIDE5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1836, 'width': 1135, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/05/arts/05GUIDE5/05GUIDE5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/05/arts/05GUIDE5/05GUIDE5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, '