', 'snippet': 'Misha Vladimirskiy has used Photoshop to create doubled images of Ed Sheeran, Tove Lo, Wiz Khalifa and more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The San Francisco-based photographer Misha Vladimirskiy, who regularly shoots for GoPro and is a member of the graphic design team Butchershop Creative, travels a great deal for his career; as a result, he spends a healthy amount of time on his own. Just over two years ago, alone and bored, Vladimirskiy started making “vignettes and self-portraits” of himself interacting with, well, himself — an effect accomplished using Photoshop. The practice wasn’t originally intended as a grand artistic statement: “It was funny, and something fun to do,” he says.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Photographer Who Introduces Celebrities to Themselves', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Celebrities', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-01T19:15:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dan Hyman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hyman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/81d33545-436a-5453-862b-1b01fb9c9e5e', 'word_count': 222, 'uri': 'nyt://article/81d33545-436a-5453-862b-1b01fb9c9e5e'}, {'abstract': 'Mahinda Rajapaksa said he would lead an opposition group in parliamentary elections in August, but stopped short of indicating that he would fight for a seat.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/02/world/asia/ex-president-of-sri-lanka-says-hell-lead-opposition-in-elections.html', 'snippet': 'Mahinda Rajapaksa said he would lead an opposition group in parliamentary elections in August, but stopped short of indicating that he would fight for a seat.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MEDAMULANA, Sri Lanka — Six months after his defeat in presidential elections, Sri Lanka’s former president took the stage on Wednesday in the gardens of his home in this southern village to tell a crowd of thousands that he would lead an opposition group in parliamentary elections in August.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/02/world/02lanka-web/02lanka-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 404, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/02/world/02lanka-web/02lanka-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 404}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/02/world/02lanka-web/02lanka-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 690, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/02/world/02lanka-web/02lanka-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1380, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/02/world/02lanka-web/02lanka-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/02/world/02lanka-web/02lanka-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/02/world/02lanka-web/02lanka-web-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], '