es', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'At the Happiest Hour, a Cheeseburger Does a Star Turn', 'kicker': 'Hungry City', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Showstopping Cheeseburger Does a Star Turn', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Happiest Hour (Manhattan, NY, Bar)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bars and Nightclubs', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Greenwich Village (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hamburgers', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-02T15:26:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff Gordinier', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gordinier', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/5d6eb2b7-f334-5c0a-a1a5-1c74b8bf7b18', 'word_count': 705, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5d6eb2b7-f334-5c0a-a1a5-1c74b8bf7b18'}, {'abstract': 'A rash of shark bites in North Carolina has raised concerns. Here’s what you need to know to stay safe.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/03/science/should-swimmers-worry-about-sharks.html', 'snippet': 'A rash of shark bites in North Carolina has raised concerns. Here’s what you need to know to stay safe.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Seven swimmers have been bitten by sharks in North Carolina in less than a month. In the most recent attack, on Wednesday, authorities said the victim was swimming in front of a lifeguard stand when a gray shark, as large as seven feet long, pulled him under the water and bit him on the rib cage, hip, lower leg and both hands.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, '