nyregion/capri-social-club-in-brooklyn-is-a-bar-so-ordinary-its-a-star.html', 'snippet': 'The minimalism of the Greenpoint establishment, one of New York’s hidden gems, has made it appealing to film scouts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The regulars do not gravitate there for its glamorous decorations or its trendy ambience. There are basic tables and chairs and a bar so old that drinkers can feel the contours in the wood from cigarette burns decades old.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/03/nyregion/FILMBARweb2/FILMBARweb2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/03/nyregion/FILMBARweb2/FILMBARweb2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/03/nyregion/FILMBARweb2/FILMBARweb2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/03/nyregion/FILMBARweb2/FILMBARweb2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/03/nyregion/FILMBARweb2/FILMBARweb2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/03/nyregion/FILMBARweb2/FILMBARweb2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/03/nyregion/FILMBARweb2/FILMBARweb2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Capri Social Club in Brooklyn Is a Bar So Ordinary, It’s a Star', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Nondescript Brooklyn Bar Is So Ordinary, It&#8217;s a Star', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Capri Social Club (Brooklyn, NY, Bar)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jamerson, Joshua', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Greenpoint (Brooklyn, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bars and Nightclubs', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-02T22:30:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joshua Jamerson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joshua', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jamerson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/739f03a9-63e3-5e3c-bd7c-66a56ca7899d', 'word_count': 845, 'uri': 'nyt://article/739f03a9-63e3-5e3c-bd7c-66a56ca7899d'}, {'abstract': 'Matthew Heineman’s on-the-ground film profiles leaders of two vigilante groups fighting drug gangs, one in Arizona and the other in Michoacán, Mexico.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/03/movies/review-in-cartel-land-documentary-vigilantes-wage-drug-wars.html', 'snippet': 'Matthew Heineman’s on-the-ground film profiles leaders of two vigilante groups fighting drug gangs, one in Arizona and the other in Michoacán, Mexico.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The director Matthew Heineman has a terrific eye. And, to judge from “Cartel Land,” his immersive documentary about American and Mexican vigilante groups, he also has guts and nerves of steel. Serving as the primary cinematographer, he employs a run-and-gun style for much of the movie, using a lightweight digital camera that at times lurches so dramatically that you can visualize the body attached to it. Considering that Mr. Heineman landed in a few shootouts while making this documentary, both his camera moves and its pictorial quality are striking. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/03/arts/03CARTELAND/03CARTELAND-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 255, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/03/arts/03CARTELAND/03CARTELAND-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 255}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/03/arts/03CARTELAND/03CARTELAND-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 436, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/03/arts/03CARTELAND/03CARTELAND-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 871, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/03/arts/03CARTELAND/03CARTELAND-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/03/arts/03CARTELAND/03CARTELAND-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/03/arts/03CARTELAND/03CARTELAND-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: In ‘Cartel Land’ Documentary, Vigilantes Wage Drug Wars', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Waging Drug Wars on Both Sides of a Border', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Heineman, Matthew', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drug Cartels', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Cartel Land (Movie)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-02T22:31:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Manohla Dargis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Manohla', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dargis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/e8bd70ab-6997-53af-8fda-cc8d3d6e8648', 'word_count': 646, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e8bd70ab-6997-53af-8fda-cc8d3d6e8648'}, {'abstract': 'On display are letters, photographs, dog tags and first editions that reflect the celebrated author’s creative process.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/03/arts/design/ernest-hemingway-between-two-wars-arriving-at-morgan-library.html', 'snippet': 'On display are letters, photographs, dog tags and first editions that reflect the celebrated author’s creative process.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ernest Hemingway was a maker of lists and a collector of his life’s ephemera. For the first time, some of the objects that this American writer gathered during his long career — bullfighting stubs from Pamplona in Spain, boastful fishing logs from expeditions off the Cuban coast, coy letters to a mistress, penciled drafts of stories — will be on display in an exhibition at the Morgan Library & Museum from Sept. 25 through Jan. 31.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/03/arts/0703INSIDEART1/0703INSIDEART1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 515, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/03/arts/0703INSIDEART1/0703INSIDEART1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 515}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/03/arts/0703INSIDEART1/0703INSIDEART1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 879, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/03/arts/0703INSIDEART1/0703INSIDEART1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1287, 'width': 1499, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/03/arts/0703INSIDEART1/0703INSIDEART1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/03/arts/0703INSIDEART1/0703INSIDEART1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/03/arts/0703INSIDEART1/0703INSIDEART1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘Ernest Hemingway: Between Two Wars’ Arriving at Morgan Library', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rough Drafts and Relics: A Hemingway Trove', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hemingway, Ernest', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Morgan Library & Museum', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rhode, Robin', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kearns, Jerry', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Times Square and 42nd Street (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-02T22:32:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Graham Bowley and Randy Kennedy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Graham', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bowley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Randy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kennedy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/04308415-86d0-52bb-94e7-b44e987fc6bb', 'word_count': 1549, 'uri': 'nyt://article/04308415-86d0-52bb-94e7-b44e987fc6bb'}, {'abstract': 'After one ranching family in the drought-stricken northern desert let its cattle graze on federally owned land, it and other families struck deals with the government to do the same.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/03/us/drought-forces-nevada-ranchers-to-take-on-washington.html', 'snippet': 'After one ranching family in the drought-stricken northern desert let its cattle graze on federally owned land, it and other families struck deals with the government to do the same.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BATTLE MOUNTAIN, Nev. — Around here they call it “going Bundy”: allowing cattle to graze illegally on federally owned land. For months, ranching families in this tiny community have itched to do it — both because of the relentless drought, which has left their own land dry and their animals hungry, and because of the anti-Washington streak that runs deep in this part of the rural West, where people fervently believe that the government owns too much land.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/30/us/01NEVADAWEB1/01NEVADAWEB1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/30/us/01NEVADAWEB1/01NEVADAWEB1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/30/us/01NEVADAWEB1/01NEVADAWEB1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/30/us/01NEVADAWEB1/01NEVADAWEB1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/30/us/01NEVADAWEB1/01NEVADAWEB1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/30/us/01NEVADAWEB1/01NEVADAWEB1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/30/us/01NEVADAWEB1/01NEVADAWEB1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Drought Pushes Nevada Ranchers to Take On Washington  ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Nevada Ranchers Pick a Fight With Washington', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Nevada', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', '