f_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/e961462f-1319-5c4a-9d5b-8968d25f6710', 'word_count': 238, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e961462f-1319-5c4a-9d5b-8968d25f6710'}, {'abstract': 'Three cases have emerged in the country since it was declared free of the virus on May 9, highlighting the continuing threat of viral outbreaks in West Africa.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/03/world/africa/liberia-reports-new-cases-of-ebola.html', 'snippet': 'Three cases have emerged in the country since it was declared free of the virus on May 9, highlighting the continuing threat of viral outbreaks in West Africa.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MONROVIA, Liberia — Three new cases of Ebola have emerged in Liberia since the country was declared free of the virus on May 9, highlighting the continuing threat of viral outbreaks in West Africa. The Liberian government said it was tracing scores of people who had recent contact with the three patients.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Liberia Reports New Cases of Ebola', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ebola Revival Is New Test for Liberia', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ebola Virus', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Liberia', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Epidemics', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson Sirleaf, Ellen', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-02T23:20:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Clair MacDougall', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Clair', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'MacDougall', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/39f60e78-6440-5eb7-ae36-5e09e8240b57', 'word_count': 513, 'uri': 'nyt://article/39f60e78-6440-5eb7-ae36-5e09e8240b57'}, {'abstract': 'United States Customs and Border Protection now indicates that Richard W. Matt tried to make a last stand when he was tracked down.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/03/nyregion/prison-escapee-was-killed-after-he-aimed-gun-at-agent-officials-say.html', 'snippet': 'United States Customs and Border Protection now indicates that Richard W. Matt tried to make a last stand when he was tracked down.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Cornered in the woods three weeks after his extraordinary escape from prison, Richard W. Matt aimed his 20-gauge shotgun at an armed federal agent late last week but was shot and killed before he could pull the trigger, the authorities said on Thursday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Prison Escapee Was Killed After He Aimed Gun at Agent, Officials Say', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fugitive Aimed Gun at Agent, Officials Say', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prison Escapes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Matt, Richard W (1967- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Clinton Correctional Facility', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Malone (NY)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders, Attempted Murders and Homicides', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-02T23:27:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Schwirtz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schwirtz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1ddfc0be-57a9-54a8-a8e0-bac281333902', 'word_count': 382, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1ddfc0be-57a9-54a8-a8e0-bac281333902'}, {'abstract': 'This story of a friendship between a boy and a wild creature takes them across the Mediterranean.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/03/movies/review-in-zarafa-a-giraffe-journeys-in-a-hot-air-balloon.html', 'snippet': 'This story of a friendship between a boy and a wild creature takes them across the Mediterranean.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Pro-giraffe and antislavery, the animated feature “Zarafa” follows an African boy, Maki, on his trek across deserts, oceans and the city of Paris to save a friend. Set in the early 1820s, when the pasha of Egypt famously gave a giraffe to King Charles X of France, this hand-drawn French adventure is a children’s story in the routine template of many friends-and-villains quests, but with a fresh historical setting and a serenely subdued look.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/03/arts/03ZARAFA/0703ZARAFA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/03/arts/03ZARAFA/0703ZARAFA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/03/arts/03ZARAFA/0703ZARAFA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 597, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/03/arts/03ZARAFA/0703ZARAFA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 944, 'width': 1618, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2