walks with her husband, shopping and having dinner with her family. But she won’t go to a restaurant without first applying concealer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/05/nyregion/how-bobbi-brown-spends-her-sundays.html', 'snippet': 'The cosmetics queen Bobbi Brown likes to spend Sundays on early walks with her husband, shopping and having dinner with her family. But she won’t go to a restaurant without first applying concealer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the head of her own cosmetics company and the editor in chief of Yahoo Beauty, Bobbi Brown is “busier than ever,” she said. The makeup artist turned entrepreneur first peddled her wares in 1991, when she introduced a line of lipsticks at Bergdorf Goodman. Four years later, her company was acquired by Estée Lauder Companies. Ms. Brown, 58, spends her Sundays walking, shopping and socializing with family in Manhattan. She lives with her husband of 27 years, Steven Plofker, also 58, “in the 20s near the High Line,” with a view of the Hudson River and of New Jersey, “where I came from.”', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/05/nyregion/05ROUTINE4/05ROUTINE4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/05/nyregion/05ROUTINE4/05ROUTINE4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/05/nyregion/05ROUTINE4/05ROUTINE4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/05/nyregion/05ROUTINE4/05ROUTINE4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumb