in for the Yankees.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/05/sports/baseball/mark-teixeiras-resurgence-as-a-leader-is-all-in-the-finally-healthy-wrist.html', 'snippet': 'Having recovered from wrist surgery in 2013, Teixeira is on pace this season finish with 40 home runs and 118 runs batted in for the Yankees.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It is all about production. Mark Teixeira has learned that lesson across 13 major league seasons. People love good players and loathe bad ones. He has been both.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/05/sports/KEPNER/KEPNER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 526, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/05/sports/KEPNER/KEPNER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 526}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/05/sports/KEPNER/KEPNER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 898, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/05/sports/KEPNER/KEPNER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1796, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/05/sports/KEPNER/KEPNER-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/05/sports/KEPNER/KEPNER-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/05/sports/KEPNER/KEPNER-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge',