ttps://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/07/06/mansur-gavriel-colette-bag-collaboration/', 'snippet': 'To celebrate a new collaboration with Colette, the duo behind the label with a cult following filled the Paris concept store’s window with an installation of their own design.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the annals of It bags with epic wait lists, there’s the iconic (the Birkin) and the more emergent, like the Bucket Bag from Mansur Gavriel, the accessories label launched by the designer friends Rachel Mansur and Floriana Gavriel in 2013. The duo’s short-order success instantly caught the attention of the fashion world’s most discerning members and saw them bestowed with the Swarovski Award for Accessory Design at the 2015 CFDA Fashion Awards last month. Beginning today, they introduce a new collaboration with Colette — a limited-edition of their bestselling Bucket Bag in pony-hair saffiano leather and iridescent blue, the Parisian concept store’s iconic color, handmade in the Italian region of Veneto — with a special window installation featuring an oversized Bucket Bag crafted entirely from paper and brimming with large, red graphic representations of anemone flowers. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Making of the Largest Mansur Gavriel Bag Standing', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mansur, Rachel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-06T19:06:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lindsey Tramuta', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lindsey', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tramuta', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 