mantling the “cartel of existing colleges and universities” that he said left too many students without viable career paths and burdened by tens of thousands of dollars in debt.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Marco Rubio Calls for Overhaul of the ‘Cartel’ of Colleges', 'kicker': 'First Draft', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rubio Calls for Overhaul of the u2018Cartelu2019 of Colleges', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Student Loans', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bush, Jeb', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Hillary Rodham', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rubio, Marco', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chicago (Ill)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-07T15:55:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Politics', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeremy W. Peters', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeremy', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Peters', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fa706a66-38fa-5af0-b483-11a4e96b85cf', 'word_count': 553, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fa706a66-38fa-5af0-b483-11a4e96b85cf'}, {'abstract': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Hungarian women who poisoned their husbands are convicted in 1890.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/07/07/1890-husband-poisoners-convicted/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Hungarian women who poisoned their husbands are convicted in 1890.', 'lead_paragraph': 'VIENNA — The Assize Court of Mitrowitz, in Hungary, yesterday [July 6] concluded its trial of ten peasant women arraigned for poisoning their husbands. Four of the prisoners were sentenced to death, one to penal servitude for life, three to fifteen years’ penal servitude, and two were acquitted. The evidence disclosed that the murderesses acted with the most cold-blooded premeditation; nor were their crimes extenuated in any way by ill treatment received at their husbands’ hands. On the contrary, the husbands seem to have been good fellows, and it does not appear that their wives cherished any strong animosity against them. — The New York Herald, European Edition, July 8, 1890', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1890: Husband Poisoners Convicted', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'HUNGARY', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marriages', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders, Attempted Murders and Homicides', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-07T16:00:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7d397e2c-e2d6-54ff-b356-6705cda53820', 'word_count': 111, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7d397e2c-e2d6-54ff-b356-6705cda53820'}, {'abstract': 'The annual tour will begin Aug. 28 in Kansas City, Mo.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/07/07/amy-schumer-aziz-ansari-to-headline-oddball-comedy-fest/', 'snippet': 'The annual tour will begin Aug. 28 in Kansas City, Mo.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Aziz Ansari and Amy Schumer — two busy multiplatform star comics – will headline the new Oddball Comedy and Curiosity Festival, which will travel to 18 cities starting Aug. 28 in Kansas City, Mo., and ending Oct. 18 in Dallas.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Amy Schumer, Aziz Ansari to Headline Oddball Comedy Fest', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ansari and Schumer To Lead Comedy Tour', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Comedy and Humor', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ansari, Aziz', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schumer, Amy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-07T16:01:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jason Zinoman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jason', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zinoman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/daa4bd79-e4ca-5cf8-a339-81945a9c06c1', 'word_count': 198, 'uri': 'nyt://article/daa4bd79-e4ca-5cf8-a339-81945a9c06c1'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Breithaupt helped found and became the pre-eminent early promoter of bicycle motocross racing. He also manufactured BMX bikes and became a television commentator on BMX.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/08/sports/scot-breithaupt-bmx-pioneer-dies-at-57.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Breithaupt helped found and became the pre-eminent early promoter of bicycle motocross racing. He also manufactured BMX bikes and became a television commentator on BMX.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Scot Breithaupt was a motocross racer for Yamaha who liked to ride his motorcycle on a rugged dirt track in Long Beach, Calif. One day in November 1970, he noticed that he was being followed by teenagers pedaling Schwinn Sting-Rays.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/08/sports/07breithaupt-1-obit/07breithaupt-1-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 391, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/08/sports/07breithaupt-1-obit/07breithaupt-1-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 391}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/08/sports/07breithaupt-1-obit/07breithaupt-1-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 668, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/08/sports/07breithaupt-1-obit/07breithaupt-1-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1335, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/08/sports/07breithaupt-1-obit/07breithaupt-1-obit-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/08/sports/07breithaupt-1-obit/07breithaupt-1-obit-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/08/sports/07breithaupt-1-obit/07breithaupt-1-obit-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Scot Breithaupt, Who Blazed a Trail in BMX, Dies at 57', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Scot Breithaupt, 57; Blazed a Trail in BMX', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bicycle Motocross', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Breithaupt, Scot (1957-2015)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-07T16:05:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Daniel E. Slotnik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Daniel', 'middlename': 'E.', 'lastname': 'Slotnik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/0ecc1490-865f-5872-9d4f-264e41fe9212', 'word_count': 468, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0ecc1490-865f-5872-9d4f-264e41fe9212'}, {'abstract': 'The editor of the journal Science says it is time to get serious about cutting greenhouse gas emissions.', 'web_url': 'https://dotearth.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/07/07/avoiding-a-climate-inferno/', 'snippet': 'The editor of the journal Science says it is time to get serious about cutting greenhouse gas emissions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The current issue\xa0of Science features a short, but forceful editorial\xa0by the journal’s editor in chief, the geophysicist Marcia K. McNutt, calling for humanity, after decades of delay, to get serious about cutting greenhouse-gas emissions linked to global warming.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/06/blogs/dotdanteinferno/dotdanteinferno-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 471, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/06/blogs/dotdanteinferno/dotdanteinferno-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 471}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/06/blogs/dotdanteinferno/dotdanteinferno-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 1019, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJum