hares his short list of where to eat traditional French food and feel appropriately dressed in pajamas (in daytime).', 'lead_paragraph': 'In January in Paris,\xa0Elie Top debuted his eponymous jewelry line during Spring/Summer 2015 Couture Week. In the months since, he’s been looking forward to another season, going on now, of what he calls “the expression of the search for perfection, a mix of tradition and advanced research” —\xa0when the fashion set, celebrities and generally fabulous types flock to his hometown to see the industry’s hautest designs. Top also remarks on the pleasant, “less tiring” rhythm of the shows during Couture Week —\xa0which leaves ample time for exploring the City of Light armed with his short list of where to eat traditional French food and feel appropriately dressed in pajamas (in daytime), which follows.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/07/t-magazine/07elie-beddie-1/07elie-beddie-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/07/t-magazine/07elie-beddie-1/07elie-beddie-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/07/t-magazine/07elie-beddie-1/07elie-beddie-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/07/t-magazine/07elie-beddie-1/07elie-beddie-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/07/t-magazine/07elie-beddie-1/07elie-beddie-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75,