'nyt://article/cf85a319-f506-5120-a80b-efbe61d8c382'}, {'abstract': 'The setup for Pope Francis’ visit to Washington on Sept. 24 will be similar to a presidential inauguration, with large screens positioned along the mall making his speech before Congress available for public viewing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2015/07/08/congress-to-broadcast-popes-speech-to-audience-outside-capitol/', 'snippet': 'The setup for Pope Francis’ visit to Washington on Sept. 24 will be similar to a presidential inauguration, with large screens positioned along the mall making his speech before Congress available for public viewing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Anticipating huge public demand for a glimpse of Pope Francis during his visit to Congress on Sept. 24, Speaker John A. Boehner said Wednesday that the speech would be broadcast live to those gathered on the West Front of the Capitol, with the possibility that the pope himself would make an appearance outside after his remarks.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/08/us/politics/08firstdraft-pope/08firstdraft-pope-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/08/us/politics/08firstdraft-pope/08firstdraft-pope-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/08/us/politics/08firstdraft-pope/08firstdraft-pope-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/08/us/politics/08firstdraft-pope/08firstdraft-pope-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, '