 says are helping fuel unrest in American cities.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/09/us/hud-issuing-new-rules-to-fight-segregation.html', 'snippet': 'The regulations are a piece of President Obama’s effort to address the racial disparities he says are helping fuel unrest in American cities.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Obama administration announced an aggressive effort on Wednesday to reduce the racial segregation of residential neighborhoods. It unveiled a new requirement that cities and localities account for how they will use federal housing funds to reduce racial disparities, or face penalties if they fail.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/09/us/09housingjp/09housingjp-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 372, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/09/us/09housingjp/09housingjp-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 372}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/09/us/09housingjp/09housingjp-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 635, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/09/us/09housingjp/09housingjp-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1269, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Obama Unveils Stricter Rules Against Segregation in Housing', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Obama Unveils Stricter Rules on Fair Housing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Davis, Julie Hirschfeld', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Affordable Housing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'},