ficked website explain their protest of the company’s latest personnel move.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We are moderators for the website reddit.com, a place where, on a typical day, millions of users read and share content in self-contained communities called “subreddits.” We volunteer our time to help manage the subsection called IAmA — a popular part of the site where thousands of interviews, known as “ask me anythings,” take place. It’s where Bill Gates has talked about the importance of vaccines, and where an airline baggage handler revealed mysteries of the trade — and where President Obama once responded to a question about the White House beer recipe by promising: “I can tell from firsthand experience, it is tasty.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/08/opinion/08lynchWeb/08lynchWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 406, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/08/opinion/08lynchWeb/08lynchWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 406}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/08/opinion/08lynchWeb/08lynchWeb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 694, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/08/opinion/08lynchWeb/08lynchWeb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1387, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/08/opinion/08lynchWeb/08lynchWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/08/opinion/08lynchWeb/08lynchWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, '