 backed by the United States, was “confrontational” and “politically motivated.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/09/world/europe/russia-vetoes-un-resolution-calling-srebrenica-massacre-crime-of-genocide.html', 'snippet': 'Russia, an ally of Serbia, objected that the measure, backed by the United States, was “confrontational” and “politically motivated.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'UNITED NATIONS — Russia vetoed a British-sponsored draft resolution in the United Nations Security Council on Wednesday condemning the Srebrenica massacre of 1995 as a “crime of genocide,” marking a new low in relations among world powers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Russia Vetoes U.N. Resolution Calling Srebrenica Massacre ‘Crime of Genocide’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Srebrenica (Bosnia and Herzegovina)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'War Crimes, Genocide and Crimes Against Humanity', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Security Council (UN)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'International Court of Justice (UN)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Churkin, Vitaly I', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Power, Samantha', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bosnia and Herzegovina', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-08T17:57:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Somini Sengupta', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Somini', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sengupta', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/86ebbb85-61c6-5dc9-bbc2-efdc74b574c1', 'word_count': 363, 'uri': 'nyt://article/86ebbb85-61c6-5dc9-bbc2-efdc74b574c1'}, {'abstract': 'The missing reel has been found for “The Battle of the Century,” a 1927 Laurel and Hardy film that features a fight that used 3,000 pies.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/12/movies/comedys-sweet-weapon-the-cream-pie.html', 'snippet': 'The missing reel has been found for “The Battle of the Century,” a 1927 Laurel and Hardy film that features a fight that used 3,000 pies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ah, the thrown pie. Among the sweetest delights in life is the sight of an airborne cream-and-crust concoction finding purchase. It is the great leveler, a puncturing of pretension, and those who find pie throwing beneath their refined comic sensibility deserve nothing more than a lemon meringue treat, smack in the kisser.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/12/arts/12PIEFIGHT7/12PIEFIGHT7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/12/arts/12PIEFIGHT7/12PIEFIGHT7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/12/arts/12PIEFIGHT7/12PIEFIGHT7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 679, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/12/arts/12PIEFIGHT7/12PIEFIGHT7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1214, 'width': 1831, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/12/arts/12PIEFIGHT7/1