en spray-painted minutes before the show. Finally, at Maison Margiela, each model came down the runway with a distinct hair look: Molly Bair, who opened the show, wore a chalky white handprint on the side of her head, while another model came out wearing a hand-painted vine that snaked from collarbone to updo.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/08/t-magazine/08trend-paint-gilchrist/08trend-paint-gilchrist-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/08/t-magazine/08trend-paint-gilchrist/08trend-paint-gilchrist-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/08/t-magazine/08trend-paint-gilchrist/08trend-paint-gilchrist-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 614, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/08/t-magazine/08trend-paint-gilchrist/08trend-paint-gilchrist-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1229, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/08/t-magazine/08trend-paint-gilchrist/08trend-paint-gilchrist-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/08/t-magazine/08trend-paint-gilchrist/08trend-paint-gilchrist-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/08/t-magazine/08trend-paint-gilchrist/08trend-paint-gilchrist-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 