s/first-draft/2015/07/08/treasury-sticks-to-plans-for-a-woman-on-the-10-bill-despite-hillary-clintons-displeasure/', 'snippet': 'Treasury Secretary Jacob J. Lew signaled no change in plans to have a woman’s portrait share the $10 bill with Alexander Hamilton, a day after Hillary Rodham Clinton, his former boss, said “a woman should have her own bill.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Of all the problems that might cause Treasury Secretary Jacob J. Lew to lose sleep – a bankrupt Greece and an aggressive China, terrorist financing and Iran sanctions, tax and banking disputes – he could hardly have foreseen that his recent “good news” announcement about seeking a woman’s portrait for the $10 bill would end up among them.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/08/us/politics/08firstdraft-clinton3/08firstdraft-clinton3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/08/us/politics/08firstdraft-clinton3/08firstdraft-clinton3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/08/us/politics/08firstdraft-clinton3/08firstdraft-clinton3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/08/us/politics/08firstdraft-clinton3/08firstdraft-clinton3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/08/us/politics/08firstdraft-clinton3/08firstdraft-clinton3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 