ook,” to help other parents in similar situations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Helen Harrison, who was so unprepared when her son was born prematurely that she later wrote a popular manual for parents in similar situations and became their advocate, died on Saturday at her home in Berkeley, Calif. She was 68.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/10/arts/10Harrison-obit/10Harrison-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 834, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/10/arts/10Harrison-obit/10Harrison-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 834}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/10/arts/10Harrison-obit/10Harrison-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 738, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/10/arts/10Harrison-obit/10Harrison-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1317, 'width': 948, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/10/arts/10Harrison-obit/10Harrison-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/10/arts/10Harrison-obit/10Harrison-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/10/arts/10Harrison-obit/10Harrison-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Helen Harrison, Authority on the Trials of Premature Births, Dies at 68', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Helen Harrison, 68, Authority on Premature Births', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Premature Babies', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pregnancy and Childbirth', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': "The Premature Baby Book: A Parents' Guide to Coping and Caring in the First Years (Book)", 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Harrison, Helen (1946-2015)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-09T02:14:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Roberts', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Roberts', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/43074d5a-5aa0-5d99-9714-fbcd1fecf0a5', 'word_count': 998, 'uri': 'nyt://article/43074d5a-5aa0-5d99-9714-fbcd1fecf0a5'}, {'abstract': 'Thierry Gueorgiou is a star of orienteering, a sport of quick navigation over terrain, and will be seeking his 13th world title in August in the Scottish Highlands.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/09/sports/orienteering-thierry-gueorgiou-key-to-winning-not-getting-lost.html', 'snippet': 'Thierry Gueorgiou is a star of orienteering, a sport of quick navigation over terrain, and will be seeking his 13th world title in August in the Scottish Highlands.', 'lead_paragraph': 'UPPSALA, Sweden — About 100 yards inside one entrance of the Lunsen forest is a rock ledge formed millenniums ago when all of Scandinavia was covered by ice. A thicket of bushes lines the near edge of a gully that drops down 15 feet. On the far edge, a group of trees rises, like fingers 