ttps://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2015/07/09/today-in-politics-senate-leaves-cybersecurity-off-its-post-holiday-rush/', 'snippet': 'Congress is making plans to accommodate the pope, two former presidents are meeting while their families squabble, and the Senate has a lengthy to-do list.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good Thursday morning from Washington. Congress is making plans to accommodate the pope, two former presidents are meeting while their families squabble, and the Senate has a lengthy to-do list. But that list does not include a cybersecurity bill the Senate deemed crucial only a few weeks ago.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/08/us/politics/08firstdraft-newsletter/08firstdraft-newsletter-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/08/us/politics/08firstdraft-newsletter/08firstdraft-newsletter-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/08/us/politics/08firstdraft-newsletter/08firstdraft-newsletter-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/08/us/politics/08firstdraft-newsletter/08firstdraft-newsletter-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/08/us/politics/08firstdraft-newsletter/08firstdraft-newsletter-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/08/us/politics/08firstdraft-newsletter/0