, 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/10/business/dealbook/barclays-faces-toughest-test-in-investment-banking.html', 'snippet': 'Barclays, Credit Suisse and Deutsche Bank have new leaders and distinct challenges in investment banking, but Barclays has the steepest climb.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Barclays faces the biggest test in retooling its investment bank. Chief executives at Barclays, Credit Suisse and Deutsche Bank have now all left, meaning new leaders will tackle their respective divisions’ futures. All three have lost market share to Wall Street over the last few years. But Barclays’ shrinking broker-dealer revenue makes it the top contender for further slippage.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/10/business/10db-barclaysviews/10db-barclaysviews-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 422, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/10/business/10db-barclaysviews/10db-barclaysviews-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 422}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/10/business/10db-barclaysviews/10db-barclaysviews-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 720, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/10/business/10db-barclaysviews/10db-barclaysviews-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1439, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/10/business/10db-barclaysviews/10db-barclaysviews-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/10/business/10db-barclaysviews/10d