2009, began devoting a sizable amount of his fortune in the 1990s to reviving the armory.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The New York City cultural landscape is mapped by the surnames of great patronage: Guggenheim, Whitney, Morgan, Frick, Cooper Hewitt and, more recently, Geffen, Koch and Bloomberg. Now the name of another donor seems likely to enter the lexicon: Wade Thompson. Mr. Thompson, who died in 2009, made his money by reviving the Airstream brand of shiny aluminum trailers, and in the 1990s, he began devoting a sizable amount of his fortune to reviving the grand but crumbling Park Avenue Armory, at 66th Street, which has transformed itself into a hangar-size stage for art, music and performance.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Thompson Family Foundation to Give Park Avenue Armory $65 Million', 'kicker': 'Inside Art', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Park Avenue Armory Gets $65 Million Gift', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Park Avenue Armory (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-09T20:55:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Randy Kennedy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Randy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kennedy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8eeff47d-43e2-5b73-86b9-cacdddbfe6b6', 'word_count': 395, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8eeff47d-43e2-5b73-86b9-cacdddbfe6b6'}, {'abstract': 'I aspired to always be my wife’s rescuer until, in our darkest moment, she rescued me.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/12/style/superheroes-just-for-each-other.html', 'snippet': 'I aspired to always be my wife’s rescuer until, in our darkest moment, she rescued me.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The first time I lifted her up and carried her away, I was acting on a whim, seeking an exit from a stupid but dangerous argument. Though we lived in the glittering center of Shanghai, we couldn’t agree on where to go for dinner.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/07/27/fashion/12MODERNLOVE/12MODERNLOVE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 796, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/07/27/fashion/12MODERNLOVE/12MODERNLOVE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 796}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/07/27/fashion/12MODERNLOVE/12MODERNLOVE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 773, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/07/27/fashion/12MODERNLOVE/12MODERNLOVE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1545, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/07/27/fashion/12MODERNLOVE/12MODERNLOVE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/07/27/fashion/12MODERNLOVE/12MODERNLOVE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/07/27/fashion/12MODERNLOVE/12MODERNLOVE-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Superheroes, Just for Each Other', 