-and-ex-goldman-partner-dies-at-85.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Marcus served as a managing director of the Metropolitan Opera beginning in 1976. Ten years later he was named chairman, a position he held until 1993.', 'lead_paragraph': 'James S. Marcus, who fell in love with opera at a student performance of Wagner’s fairy tale “Lohengrin” when he was 9 and who went on to become a board chairman and benefactor of the Metropolitan Opera, died on July 5 in Manhattan. He was 85.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/10/arts/10marcus-obit/10marcus-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 385, 'width': 277, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/10/arts/10marcus-obit/10marcus-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 385, 'width': 277, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/10/arts/10marcus-obit/10marcus-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/10/arts/10marcus-obit/10marcus-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/10/arts/10marcus-obit/10marcus-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'James Marcus, Opera Benefactor and Ex-Goldman Partner, Dies at 85', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'James S. Marcus, 85, Former Met Opera Chairman', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Death