', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Bornstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bornstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/225257c9-1aa4-5046-934b-df6b7d1a090d', 'word_count': 1955, 'uri': 'nyt://article/225257c9-1aa4-5046-934b-df6b7d1a090d'}, {'abstract': 'Furillen, a remote peninsula on Gotland, an island in the Baltic Sea, is the perfect hideaway from the digital world.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/12/travel/going-off-the-grid-on-a-swedish-island.html', 'snippet': 'Furillen, a remote peninsula on Gotland, an island in the Baltic Sea, is the perfect hideaway from the digital world.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I needed a break.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Going Off the Grid on a Swedish Island', 'kicker': 'Personal Journeys', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Unplugging in a Hermit Hut', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Ingrid K', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Gotland Island (Sweden)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Furillen (Sweden)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sweden', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-10T11:00:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ingrid K. Williams', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ingrid', 'middlename': 'K.', 'lastname': 'Williams', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4bebdfa3-e2c7-5719-8273-4bcf1e6ea2f5', 'word_count': 15