5/07/12/movies/as-superheroes-go-ant-man-was-always-a-wimp.html', 'snippet': 'Surrounded by other Marvel characters like Spider-Man and the Fantastic Four, Ant-Man had an inferiority complex.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the Marvel Comics big bang of the early 1960s that brought forth memorable characters like the Fantastic Four, the Amazing Spider-Man and the Mighty Thor, Ant-Man always seemed like a mortified orphan. Thor was an Asgardian god; Ant-Man had the strength of a regular joe. Spidey reveled in snappy repartee; Ant-Man cooed to ants. The Thing’s catch phrase was “It’s clobberin’ time!” Ant-Man was never known to shriek, “It’s shrinkin’ time!”', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/12/arts/12ANTSIDE/12ANTSIDE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 887, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/12/arts/12ANTSIDE/12ANTSIDE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 887}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/12/arts/12ANTSIDE/12ANTSIDE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 693, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/12/arts/12ANTSIDE/12ANTSIDE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2000, 'width': 1353, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/12/arts/12ANTSIDE/12ANTSIDE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/12/arts/12ANTSIDE/12ANTSIDE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge