avid Wilson — will also be developing site-specific artworks for FLOW.15, an outdoor art exhibition on Randalls Island aimed at fostering appreciation of the shoreline. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/12/arts/12GUIDE5/12GUIDE5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 614, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/12/arts/12GUIDE5/12GUIDE5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 614}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/12/arts/12GUIDE5/12GUIDE5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1001, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/12/arts/12GUIDE5/12GUIDE5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1080, 'width': 1055, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/12/arts/12GUIDE5/12GUIDE5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/12/arts/12GUIDE5/12GUIDE5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/12/arts/12GUIDE5/12GUIDE5-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Bronx Museum Showcases (and Helps) Emerging Artists', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Art; Even Collagists Have to Do Taxes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bronx Museum of th