the media plays in the presidential campaign.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2015/07/10/bill-clintons-candid-views-of-the-political-press/', 'snippet': 'Bill Clinton on Thursday provided a candid look at how he and his wife, Hillary Rodham Clinton, about the role the media plays in the presidential campaign.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hillary Rodham Clinton’s relations with the political news media had been tense long before she declared her candidacy in April, and her campaign’s efforts to try and improve those relations have backfired at times.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/10/us/politics/10firstdraft-clinton/10firstdraft-clinton-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/10/us/politics/10firstdraft-clinton/10firstdraft-clinton-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/10/us/politics/10firstdraft-clinton/10firstdraft-clinton-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/10/us/politics/10firstdraft-clinton/10firstdraft-clinton-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/10/us/politics/10firstdraft-clinton/10firstdraft-clinton-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/10/us/politics/10firstdraft-clinton/10firstdraft-clinton-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnail