'abstract': 'On Thursday, this violinist played Steve Reich’s “Violin Phase,” which features a present performance intertwined with a past one.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/11/arts/music/review-todd-reynolds-live-and-recorded-at-the-jewish-museum.html', 'snippet': 'On Thursday, this violinist played Steve Reich’s “Violin Phase,” which features a present performance intertwined with a past one.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Technically speaking, Thursday’s performance by the violinist Todd Reynolds at the Jewish Museum was a solo recital. After all, there were no other performers, unless you count the video artist Luke Dubois, who created expressive projections, live, for some of the pieces. And yet what Mr. Reynolds conjured with the help of his violin, an array of electronic equipment and, occasionally, a foot-pedal-operated drum, sounded very much like chamber music. Call it echo-chamber music, if you like.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/11/arts/11REYNOLDS/11REYNOLDS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/11/arts/11REYNOLDS/11REYNOLDS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/11/arts/11REYNOLDS/11REYNOLDS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/11/arts/11REYNOLDS/11REYNOLDS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/11/arts/11REYNOLDS