ope Francis highlighted Paraguay’s history to emphasize its resilience, but also criticized corruption, a delicate issue in one of Latin America’s poorest countries.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/12/world/americas/as-latin-tour-nears-end-pope-travels-to-paraguay.html', 'snippet': 'Pope Francis highlighted Paraguay’s history to emphasize its resilience, but also criticized corruption, a delicate issue in one of Latin America’s poorest countries.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ASUNCIÓN, Paraguay — Pope Francis on Saturday highlighted two crucial periods in Paraguay’s history as a way to emphasize the importance of resilience in one of Latin America’s poorest countries.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'As Latin Tour Nears End, Pope Travels to Paraguay', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'As Latin Tour Nears End, Pope Travels to Paraguay', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Francis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romero, Simon', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paraguay', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Roman Catholic Church', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Latin America', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-12T00:24:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Americas', 'byline': {'original': 'By Simon Romero', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Simon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Romero', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/01aca9ea-b6ee-569f-93e6-beb41b6bde4b', 'word_count': 496, 'uri': 'nyt://article/01aca9ea-b6ee-569f-93e6-beb41b6bde4b'}, {'abstract': 'In a speech that lasted more than an hour, Mr. Trump foc