back against some proposals and rifts emerging among the 19 nations using the euro over how far to go in making new demands.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/13/world/europe/greece-debt-plan.html', 'snippet': 'The mood was tense, with some Greek officials pushing back against some proposals and rifts emerging among the 19 nations using the euro over how far to go in making new demands.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BRUSSELS — Haggling through the night into Monday morning over a deal to calm Greece’s debt crisis, European leaders demanded that Athens make new concessions and quickly adopt a host of economic policy changes as they worked to overcome deep divisions and avert a historic fracture in the Continent’s common currency.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/13/world/13GREECE-WEB/13GREECE-WEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 408, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/13/world/13GREECE-WEB/13GREECE-WEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 408}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/13/world/13GREECE-WEB/13GREECE-WEB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 696, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/13/world/13GREECE-WEB/13GREECE-WEB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1392, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/13/world/13GREECE-WEB/13GREECE-WEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/13/world/13