times.com/2015/07/12/1915-austrian-retreat-also-forces-germans-to-retire-in-poland/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Russians make progress in Poland in 1915.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — The outlook for the Russians is still very encouraging in South Poland. For more than a week the Austro-German forces between the Vistula and the Bug have been unable to make any progress in their advance toward Lublin and Kholm. The Russians maintain all the advantages won by their crushing blow against the Austrian army under Archduke Joseph near Krasnik, on the road to Lublin. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/13/blogs/13iht-old1915/13iht-old1915-articleLarge.png', 'height': 474, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/13/blogs/13iht-old1915/13iht-old1915-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 474}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/13/blogs/13iht-old1915/13iht-old1915-jumbo.png', 'height': 759, 'width': 960, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/13/blogs/13iht-old1915/13iht-old1915-superJumbo.png', 'height': 759, 'width': 960, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/13/blogs/13iht-old1915/13iht-old1915-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/13/blogs/13iht-old1915/13iht-old1915-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'im