rimes, died on Friday in Ontario, Canada. He was 88.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/13/arts/13VICKERS-OBIT-1/13VICKERS-OBIT-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 880, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/13/arts/13VICKERS-OBIT-1/13VICKERS-OBIT-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 880}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/13/arts/13VICKERS-OBIT-1/13VICKERS-OBIT-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 698, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/13/arts/13VICKERS-OBIT-1/13VICKERS-OBIT-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1396, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/13/arts/13VICKERS-OBIT-1/13VICKERS-OBIT-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/13/arts/13VICKERS-OBIT-1/13VICKERS-OBIT-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/13/arts/13VICKERS-OBIT-1/13VICKERS-OBIT-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Jon Vickers, Opera Star Known for His Raw Power and Intensity, Dies at 88  ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jon Vickers, Opera Star of Raw Power, Is Dead at 88 ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', '