blic-sector unions, has also promoted his adherence to socially conservative values like opposition to same-sex marriage.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/14/us/politics/scott-walker-on-the-issues.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Walker, a fiscal conservative who has taken on Wisconsin’s public-sector unions, has also promoted his adherence to socially conservative values like opposition to same-sex marriage.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gov. Scott Walker of Wisconsin announced his candidacy for the Republican presidential nomination on Monday. A fiscal conservative who has taken on Wisconsin’s public-sector unions, Mr. Walker has also promoted his adherence to socially conservative values like opposition to same-sex marriage. Here are his stances on important issues.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/11/us/14ISSUES-web/14ISSUES-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/11/us/14ISSUES-web/14ISSUES-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/11/us/14ISSUES-web/14ISSUES-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/11/us/14ISSUES-web/14ISSUES-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/11/us/14ISSUES-web/14ISSUES-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/11/us/14ISSUES-web/14ISSUES-web-thu