gated, but the firm was simply going about its normal business.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With Greece’s economy and its future in the eurozone both teetering, the usually astute Robert Reich has dredged up the sorry old trope that Goldman Sachs is to blame for everything, proving yet again that even a Rhodes Scholar and former cabinet secretary is clueless about the role Wall Street firms play for their clients.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/13/business/dealbook/dbpix-reich/dbpix-reich-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/13/business/dealbook/dbpix-reich/dbpix-reich-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/13/business/dealbook/dbpix-reich/dbpix-reich-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/13/business/dealbook/dbpix-reich/dbpix-reich-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1022, 'width': 1533, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/13/business/dealbook/dbpix-reich/dbpix-reich-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/13/business/dealbook/dbpix-reich/dbpix-reich-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/13/business/dealbook/dbpix-reich/dbpix-reich-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Plenty Deserve Blame for Greece’s Woes, but Maybe Not Goldman Sachs', 'kicker': 'Street Scene', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Goldman Sachs Group Inc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Reich, Robert B', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Greece', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Collateralized Debt Obligations', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-13T19:08:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'By William D. Cohan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ea6524b2-8bf7-5bee-a9c8-2bca672d0cb5', 'word_count': 1254, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ea6524b2-8bf7-5bee-a9c8-2bca672d0cb5'}, {'abstract': 'Tunisia’s interior minister said the men, who belonged to the group Oqba Ibn Nafa, were trying to establish an armed presence in the south of the country.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/14/world/africa/tunisian-forces-kill-3-senior-leaders-of-insurgent-group.html', 'snippet': 'Tunisia’s interior minister said the men, who belonged to the group Oqba Ibn Nafa, were trying to establish an armed presence in the south of the country.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TUNIS — Tunisia’s interior minister said security forces had killed three senior leaders of an insurgent group who were trying to establish an armed presence in the south of the country.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tunisian Forces Kill 3 Senior Leaders of Insurgent Group', 'kicker': 'World Briefing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Africa; Tunisia: Three Insurgent Leaders Are Killed', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tunisia', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Oqba Ibn Nafa', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-13T19:13:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Carlotta Gall', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Carlotta', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gall', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/352c6339-a8d6-5f0d-855b-ef4684373aef', 'word_count': 230, 'uri': 'nyt://article/352c6339-a8d6-5f0d-855b-ef4684373aef'}, {'abstract': 'An eight-course tasting menu debuts; new varities of hand-strained Greek yogurt; a large underground cafe and market; and more.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/15/dining/dominique-ansel-moves-from-cronuts-to-dessert-tastings.html', 'snippet': 'An eight-course tasting menu debuts; new varities of hand-strained Greek yogurt; a large underground cafe and market; and more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The famous Cronut was not inventive enough for Dominique Ansel. “I wanted the freedom to go back to preparing more creative plated desserts,” he said. Beginning Friday, he will serve a dessert tasting in the second-floor kitchen at his West Village location, which he opened in the spring. The eight-course menu, starting at $75, will be presented at a table that descends from the ceiling on cables to eight people at each of two seatings on Fridays, Saturdays and Sundays. He calls the tasting U.P. for unlimited possibilities. “The theme for the first six months is firsts,” he said, adding, “desserts that express a first word, first kiss, first dance and, my favorite, first heartbreak, and so forth.” For first word he is serving a delicate meringue, like a floating island that may please a toddler, with sauces and garnishes of sweet peas and carrot cake: U.P. by Dominique Ansel, 137 Seventh Avenue South (10th Street), 212-242-5111, prepaid reservations available Mondays at noon for dates seven weeks later, dominiqueanselkitchen\xad.com\xad/up.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/15/dining/15BURN2/15BURN2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/15/dining/15BURN2/15BURN2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/15/dining/15BURN2/15BURN2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/15/dining/15BURN2/15BURN2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/15/dining/15BURN2/15BURN2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/15/dining/15BURN2/15BURN2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/15/dining/15BURN2/15BURN2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Dominique Ansel Moves From Cronuts to Dessert Tastings', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ansel, Dominique', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Desserts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-13T19:14:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/77ea3544-ddda-5c5d-82fd-00bcbcced67e', 'word_count': 702, 'uri': 'nyt://article/77ea3544-ddda-5c5d-82fd-00bcbcced67e'}, {'abstract': 'The risks of using genetically modified organisms are similar to those that led to the financial crisis, the authors contend.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/14/business/dealbook/another-too-big-to-fail-system-in-gmos.html', 'snippet': 'The risks of using genetically modified organisms are similar to those that led to the financial crisis, the authors contend.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Before the crisis that started in 2007, both of us believed that the financial system was fragile and unsustainable, contrary to the near ubiquitous analyses at the time.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Another ‘Too Big to Fail’ System in G.M.O.s', 'kicker': 'Another View', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name'