 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/0de0e7ec-d175-550b-9ecb-0198b7c5b1dd'}, {'abstract': 'Restored lofts, restaurants and stylish boutiques are popping up in the landmarked neighborhood.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2015/07/13/travel/where-to-go-in-the-north-loop-of-minneapolis.html', 'snippet': 'Restored lofts, restaurants and stylish boutiques are popping up in the landmarked neighborhood.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Restored lofts, restaurants and stylish boutiques are popping up in the landmarked neighborhood.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/19/travel/19SURFACING2/19SURFACING2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/19/travel/19SURFACING2/19SURFACING2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/19/travel/19SURFACING2/19SURFACING2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/19/travel/19SURFACING2/19SURFACING2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/19/travel/19SURFACING2/19SURFACING2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/19/travel/19SURFACING2/19SURFACING2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/19/travel/19SURFACING2/19SURFACING