ce themselves from Donald J. Trump, Gov. Chris Christie is stressing his close friendship with the real estate mogul, even as he criticizes him.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2015/07/13/chris-christie-still-likes-donald-trump-despite-comments-on-immigrants/', 'snippet': 'At a time when many Republicans are racing to distance themselves from Donald J. Trump, Gov. Chris Christie is stressing his close friendship with the real estate mogul, even as he criticizes him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At a time when many Republicans are racing to distance themselves from Donald J. Trump, Gov. Chris Christie of New Jersey is forging an unusual path: He’s taking pains to emphasize that, although he found Mr. Trump’s comments on illegal immigrants “inappropriate,” the real estate baron is a “friend,” the two are “close” and Mr. Trump is “a good guy.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/14/us/13FIRSTDRAFT-christietrump/13FIRSTDRAFT-christietrump-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/14/us/13FIRSTDRAFT-christietrump/13FIRSTDRAFT-christietrump-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/14/us/13FIRSTDRAFT-christietrump/13FIRSTDRAFT-christietrump-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/14/us/13FIRSTDRAFT-christietrump/13FIRSTDRAFT-christietrump-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1362, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/0