/f724181f-7a74-5a0d-8c81-71a015454aa7'}, {'abstract': 'A tender hip-hop love song about loyalty and cooking drugs, “Trap Queen” is propelling a Paterson, N.J., rapper to fame.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/14/arts/music/fetty-waps-tweaked-sound-yields-hit-in-trap-queen.html', 'snippet': 'A tender hip-hop love song about loyalty and cooking drugs, “Trap Queen” is propelling a Paterson, N.J., rapper to fame.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last year, Fetty Wap released his debut single, “Trap Queen,” a serenade directed at a woman who remains true even in difficult circumstances. From its opening wink — “I’m like, ‘Hey, what’s up? Hello.’\xa0” — to its highly digitally processed cheerful boasts of bonding over illicit activities, it’s almost saccharine. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/14/arts/14FETTWAP/14FETTWAP-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 331, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/14/arts/14FETTWAP/14FETTWAP-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 331}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/14/arts/14FETTWAP/14FETTWAP-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 565, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/14/arts/14FETTWAP/14FETTWAP-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1130, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/14/arts/14FETTWAP/14FETTWAP-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/14/arts/14FETTWAP/14