 Motel in Memphis, site of the Rev. Dr. Martin Luther King Jr.’s assassination, into a civil rights museum.', 'lead_paragraph': 'D’Army Bailey, a lifelong civil rights crusader who successfully campaigned to transform the forlorn motel where the Rev. Dr. Martin Luther King Jr. was assassinated in 1968 into a civil rights museum, died on Sunday in Memphis. He was 73.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/14/us/14Bailey-obit/14Bailey-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 404, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/14/us/14Bailey-obit/14Bailey-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 404}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/14/us/14Bailey-obit/14Bailey-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 690, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/14/us/14Bailey-obit/14Bailey-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1380, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/14/us/14Bailey-obit/14Bailey-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/14/us/14Bailey-obit/14Bailey-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/14/us/14Bailey-obit/14Bailey-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'D’Army Bailey, 73, Activist Who Founded Museum Where Dr. King Was Shot, Dies ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'D’Army Bailey, 73, Activist Who Founded Museum Where Dr. King Was Shot, Dies', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civil Rights Movement (1954-68)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Civil Rights Museum', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'King, Martin Luther Jr', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': "Bailey, D'Army (1941-2015)", 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-14T01:15:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Roberts', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Roberts', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/5276554e-d174-5a67-b56c-e49b063ec7e1', 'word_count': 813, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5276554e-d174-5a67-b56c-e49b063ec7e1'}, {'abstract': 'Greinke said he thought he pitched better with Kansas City in 2009, even though his earned run average, 1.39, is the lowest before the All-Star break since 1968 and he has not allowed a run in his last 35 2/3 innings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/14/sports/baseball/zack-greinke-says-hes-been-better-but-hitters-may-disagree.html', 'snippet': 'Greinke said he thought he pitched better with Kansas City in 2009, even though his earned run average, 1.39, is the lowest before the All-Star break since 1968 and he has not allowed a run in his last 35 2/3 innings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CINCINNATI — Before he would trust the scouting acumen of Clayton Kershaw, Zack Greinke had to test him. Greinke, the National League’s starting pitcher in the All-Star Game on Tuesday, does not need to evaluate amateurs to earn his paycheck from the Los Angeles Dodgers. But he takes his hobby seriously, and even a teammate as accomplished as Kershaw might not have an eye for talent.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/14/sports/KEPNER1/KEPNER1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 379, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/14/sports/KEPNER1/KEPNER1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 379}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/14/sports/KEPNER1/KEPNER1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 647, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/14/sports/KEPNER1/KEPNER1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1294, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/14/sports/KEPNER1/KEPNER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/14/sports/KEPNER1/KEPNER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/14/sports/KEPNER1/KEPNER1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Zack Greinke Says He’s Been Better, but Hitters May Disagree', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sorry, Hitters: Greinke Thinks He Can Be Better ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'k