her musical peers straddle wrecking balls and shoot fireworks from their bras, the gamine 27-year-old French singer offers an awkward, androgynous and totally rocking alternative.', 'lead_paragraph': 'While her musical peers straddle wrecking balls and shoot fireworks from their bras, the gamine 27-year-old French singer offers an awkward, androgynous and totally rocking alternative.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '39', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Christine and the Queens, and the Opposite of Sex', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Opposite of Sex', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lorde', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Madonna', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Los Angeles (Calif)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-14T09:45:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mary H. K. Choi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mary', 'middlename': 'H.', 'lastname': 'K', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e7f7e50f-daa0-5192-945c-8cf37341f8e0', 'word_count': 615, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e7f7e50f-daa0-5192-945c-8cf37341f8e0'}, {'abstract': 'Meet Calu Rivero, an Argentine actress whose environmentally friendly style blends comfort with cowhand, minus the leather.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/16/fashion/buenos-aires-argentina-palermo-soho-calu-rivero-fashion.html', 'snippet': 'Meet Calu Rivero, an Argentine actress whose environmentally friendly style blends comfort with cowhand, minus the leather.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Palermo Soho, the trendy Buenos Aires shopping area, is a center of style in South America. The neighborhood’s cobblestone streets, lined with high-end boutiques, European-style cafes and addictive gelato parlors, draw in stylish residents. “You have a lot of classy people, wearing all black or total jeans,” said Calu Rivero, an Argentine actress who used to live in the area. “Today I saw a girl in all red and said, ‘You’re so beautiful!’ ” Ms. Rivero was recently there wearing jeans and a jacket from Etiqueta Negra, an Argentine label, and shoes from Stella McCartney. She pointed out that the shoes were fake leather because she’s a self-proclaimed “eco-warrior girl.” (This interview has been edited and condensed.)', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'An Eco-Warrior and Cowgirl Meet in Buenos Aires', 'kicker': 'Intersection', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Cowgirl Eco-Warrior', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Buenos Aires (Argentina)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rivero, Calu (Actor)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-14T09:48:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Oresti Tsonopoulos', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Oresti', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tsonopoulos', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3ac65e1d-c815-585b-a340-a9f62039df5d', 'word_count': 300, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3ac65e1d-c815-585b-a340-a9f62039df5d'}, {'abstract': 'After the authorities effectively shut down the Beijing Independent Film Festival last year, a team decided to take a selection of Chinese movies to New York. The films will be screened from Aug. 7 to Sept. 13, featuring works by Ai Weiwei, Hu Jie, Li Luo, Zou Xueping and Yang Mingming.', 'web_url': 'https://sinosphere.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/07/14/cinema-on-the-edge-to-take-chinese-movies-to-new-york/', 'snippet': 'After the authorities effectively shut down the Beijing Independent Film Festival last year, a team decided to take a selection of Chinese movies to New York. The films will be screened from Aug. 7 to Sept. 13, featuring works by Ai Weiwei, Hu Jie...', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last August, Li Xianting, the organizer of the Beijing Independent Film Festival, received an unexpected visit from dozens of police officers and local officials at his offices in Songzhuang, a village on the eastern outskirts of Beijing. They confiscated documents, computers and films and temporarily detained two of the event’s organizers, effectively shutting down one of China’s most prominent independent film festivals.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/14/world/14SINO-FILMS02/14SINO-FILMS02-articleLarge.png', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/14/world/14SINO-FILMS02/14SINO-FILMS02-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/14/world/14SINO-FILMS02/14SINO-FILMS02-jumbo.png', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/14/world/14SINO-FILMS02/14SINO-FILMS02-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1080, 'width': 1620, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/14/world/14SINO-FILMS02/14SINO-