dia company in a multiyear deal as both companies hope to expand their reach.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/15/business/media/verizon-to-add-vice-content-to-its-coming-mobile-video-service.html', 'snippet': 'The communications giant has teamed up with the youth-oriented media company in a multiyear deal as both companies hope to expand their reach.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Verizon Communications is adding Vice Media’s youth-oriented entertainment content to its roster of programs that will be available on its mobile-first video service that is expected to start this year.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Verizon to Add Vice Content to Its Coming Mobile Video Service', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Verizon Communications Inc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Vice Media Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Media', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mobile Applications', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-14T13:50:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Emily Steel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Emily', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Steel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/37d85960-5f49-5901-a6a8-6be328dc27ef', 'word_count': 321, 'uri': 'nyt://article/37d85960-5f49-5901-a6a8-6be328dc27ef'}, {'abstract': 'The police fired shots into the air, used tear gas and beat demonstrators to disperse the crowds, an advocacy group said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/15/world/asia/tenzin-delek-rinpoche-tibet-body.html', 'snippet': 'The police fired shots into the air, used tear gas and beat demonstrators to disperse the crowds, an advocacy group said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HONG KONG — The death of a Tibetan spiritual leader in a Chinese jail has led to a violent protest by Tibetans demanding the return of his body to his family, according to news reports and an advocacy group.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Protesters Seek Return of Body of Tibetan Monk Who Died in Jail', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Monk’s Death in Chinese Jail Stirs Protest', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tibet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tenzin Delek Rinpoche (1950-2015)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sichuan Province (China)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Monasteries and Monks', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-14T13:51:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick Boehler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Boehler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/515345c9-d1a1-53b3-b3a4-47ce661776d5', 'word_count': 315, 'uri': 'nyt://article/515345c9-d1a1-53b3-b3a4-47ce661776d5'}, {'abstract': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Greeks are being persecuted and dispersed among remote villages in Turkey in 1915.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/07/14/1915-greeks-persecuted-in-turkey/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Greeks are being persecuted and dispersed among remote villages in Turkey in 1915.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON— A despatch from Athens states that the Greek Parliament, which was to have met on July 20, will not be convoked till August. According to information published in Athens the systematic persecution of the Greeks in European and Asiatic Turkey is being carried out on a plan suggested by the Germans. The Ottoman authorities are acting with methodical cruelty and leaving no stone unturned in their efforts to exterminate Greek influence. Greek women and children are being taken away to villages in the interior, where they are forced to become Mohammedans. — The New York Herald, European Edition, July 15, 1915', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1915: Greeks Persecuted in Turkey', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'turkey', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World War I (1914-18)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-14T13:57:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8ae4fea5-d07d-5d07-b3f5-c99b144555bb', 'word_count': 102, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8ae4fea5-d07d-5d07-b3f5-c99b144555bb'}, {'abstract': 'The full transcript, as provided by the White House, of President Obama’s remarks Tuesday morning on the nuclear deal with Iran.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/15/world/middleeast/text-and-video-obamas-address-on-the-ira