 is a good place for seasonal food that flirts with French ideas in exciting ways.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The night was humid, and I was drinking cold rosé at the black-veined marble counter that faces the kitchen of Rebelle. The couple on my left had rosé in their glasses, too. I did what one member of the pink wine fellowship does when encountering other members, and offered them a taste.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Restaurant Review: Rebelle in NoLIta', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Seasonal Food in a French Flirtation', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wells, Pete (Per)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Rebelle (Manhattan, NY, Restaurant)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'NoLIta (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-14T15:28:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Pete Wells', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Pete', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wells', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/da51a1f4-0e18-53fa-923c-0a00448ad014', 'word_count': 1163, 'uri': 'nyt://article/da51a1f4-0e18-53fa-923c-0a00448ad014'}, {'abstract': 'The $1 million donation for the planned Eisenhower memorial is in recognition of Eisenhower’s “staunch support” for Taiwan’s security.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/07/14/taiwan-contributing-1-million-to-eisenhower-memorial-in-washington/', 'snippet': 'The $1 million donation for the planned Eisenhower memorial is in recognition of Eisenhower’s “staunch support” for Taiwan’s security.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The memorial