mpany specializes in teasing the eye through lighting and video effects, often exploring themes related to nature. (Recent entries in its globally touring repertoire include “Botanica,” about the seasons, and “Lunar Sea,” about the moon.) Even if there’s not much choreographic substance, there’s cool stuff to see.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/15/arts/15MOMIX/15MOMIX-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 160, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/15/arts/15MOMIX/15MOMIX-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 160}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/15/arts/15MOMIX/15MOMIX-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 273, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/15/arts/15MOMIX/15MOMIX-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 546, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/15/arts/15MOMIX/15MOMIX-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/15/arts/15MOMIX/15MOMIX-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/15/arts/15MOMIX/15MOMIX-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: Momix Shoots for Astonishment With ‘Alchemia’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': ' Glow-in-the-Dark Skeletons With Nerve Endings, and Even More Stuff ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pendleton, Moses', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Momix Dance Troupe', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-14T22:27:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Siobhan Burke', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Siobhan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Burke', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/974fe7f9-2223-5900-9f4c-88b488bdf132', 'word_count': 416, 'uri': 'nyt://article/974fe7f9-2223-5900-9f4c-88b488bdf132'}, {'abstract': 'One of the most anticipated presentations of men’s fashion week featured models alongside some stealthily famous faces.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/14/fashion/mens-style/not-the-usual-suspects-at-the-public-school-show.html', 'snippet': 'One of the most anticipated presentations of men’s fashion week featured models alongside some stealthily famous faces.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There they were, their heads hovering around the line marking 6 feet, arrayed like perps in a jailhouse lineup. They wore solemn-colored sportswear, in black, white or blue: varsity jackets and shorts, rib-cuffed track pants and sleek tailored jackets.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/14/fashion/14nyfwmpublicschool-1/14nyfwmpublicschool-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/14/fashion/14nyfwmpublicschool-1/14nyfwmpublicschool-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 39