bombers has been ignored by the government, with no official events to mark its anniversary and no physical memorial for the dead.', 'web_url': 'https://sinosphere.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/07/15/a-gap-lingers-in-taiwans-wartime-memory/', 'snippet': 'Some say a 1945 air raid on Taipei by American bombers has been ignored by the government, with no official events to mark its anniversary and no physical memorial for the dead.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This month, after a military parade featuring troops riding motorcycles and mountain bikes, Apache attack helicopters flying in formation and shirtless frogmen waving paddles from the backs of trucks, President Ma Ying-jeou of Taiwan told a handful of World War II veterans that their contribution to defeating Japan was not forgotten.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/16/blogs/16sino-letter03/16sino-letter03-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 369, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/16/blogs/16sino-letter03/16sino-letter03-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 369}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/16/blogs/16sino-letter03/16sino-letter03-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 590, 'width': 960, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/16/blogs/16sino-letter03/16sino-letter03-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 590, 'width': 960, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/16/blogs/16sino-letter03/16sino-letter03-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 