https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/07/15/the-rapper-young-thug-is-arrested-in-georgia-report-says/', 'snippet': 'Young Thug was reported to have been arrested for threatening to shoot a mall security guard.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Atlanta rapper Young Thug was arrested Wednesday morning by United States Marshals in Georgia for making “terroristic threats” against a mall security guard, Jim Joyner, a supervisor for the Marshals Southeast Regional Fugitive Task Force, said. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Rapper Young Thug Is Arrested in Georgia', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Rapper Young Thug Is Arrested in Georgia', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rap and Hip-Hop', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Threats and Threatening Messages', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Jeffery Lamar (Young Thug)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Georgia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-15T17:36:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew R. Chow', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': 'R.', 'lastname': 'Chow', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a69ef1ae-df71-5c99-9d07-8d68ffb2febe', 'word_count': 126, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a69ef1ae-df71-5c99-9d07-8d68ffb2febe'}, {'abstract': 'Mayor Bill de Blasio, Michael Moore, Tony Kushner and Walter Mosley will be among the speakers on Oct. 24 as The Nation concludes its 150th-anniversary celebration.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/07/15/the-mayor-a-filmmaker-and-more-as-the-nation-wraps-up-150th-anniversary-celebration/', 'snippet': 'Mayor