36be62adc'}, {'abstract': 'Gov. Scott Walker of Wisconsin said the decision on the ban on gay scoutmasters was “up to the Boy Scouts,” and also answered a question about picking a vice-presidential running mate.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2015/07/15/scott-walker-tries-to-clarify-remarks-on-gay-scout-leaders/', 'snippet': 'Gov. Scott Walker of Wisconsin said the decision on the ban on gay scoutmasters was “up to the Boy Scouts,” and also answered a question about picking a vice-presidential running mate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LEXINGTON, S.C. – Gov. Scott Walker, who recently expressed support for a ban on gay Boy Scout leaders because it “protected children,” said Wednesday that he did not mean that children needed “physical protection” from gay scoutmasters — but rather protection from the debate over the ban.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/15/us/politics/15firstdraft-walker5/15firstdraft-walker5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/15/us/politics/15firstdraft-walker5/15firstdraft-walker5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/15/us/politics/15firstdraft-walker5/15firstdraft-walker5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/15/us/politics/15firstdraft-walker5/15firstdraft-walker5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/15/us/politics/15firstdraft-w