ocrat who was indicted on corruption charges in April, is an outspoken critic of President Obama’s nuclear negotiations with Iran.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/16/nyregion/pro-israel-billionaires-from-both-parties-aid-menendezs-defense-fund.html', 'snippet': 'Senator Robert Menendez, a New Jersey Democrat who was indicted on corruption charges in April, is an outspoken critic of President Obama’s nuclear negotiations with Iran.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Senator Robert Menendez of New Jersey, who was indicted in April on corruption charges, raised nearly $1.6 million for his legal defense fund in the second quarter of the year, including from some of the country’s most prominent pro-Israel billionaires, according to a disclosure report filed this week.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pro-Israel Billionaires From Both Parties Aid Menendez’s Defense Fund', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rich Backers of Israel Assist Menendez', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Burns, Alexander', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Menendez, Robert', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bribery and Kickbacks', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ethics and Official Misconduct', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-16T00:19:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alexander Burns', 'person': [{'firstn