a87925'}, {'abstract': 'Hillary Rodham Clinton’s presidential campaign put out a list Wednesday of supporters from Wall Street to Hollywood who have raised at least $100,000 for her campaign by hosting events.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2015/07/16/hillary-clintons-hillblazers-list-is-a-whos-who-of-big-donors/', 'snippet': 'Hillary Rodham Clinton’s presidential campaign put out a list Wednesday of supporters from Wall Street to Hollywood who have raised at least $100,000 for her campaign by hosting events.', 'lead_paragraph': 'While Hillary Rodham Clinton has called for reining in a “dysfunctional” campaign finance system, she has nonetheless shown a time-tested ability to attract money from rich and powerful supporters around the country.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/22/us/15filings-clinton2/15filings-clinton2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/22/us/15filings-clinton2/15filings-clinton2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/22/us/15filings-clinton2/15filings-clinton2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/22/us/15filings-clinton2/15filings-clinton2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/22/us/15filings-clinton2/15filings-clinton2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy'