ith a consortium led by the private equity firm Permira.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN FRANCISCO — EBay is close to selling its Enterprise unit for roughly $900 million to a consortium led by the private equity firm Permira, according to a person with knowledge of the matter.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'EBay Is Said to Be Near Sale of Enterprise Unit for $900 Million', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'E-Commerce', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'eBay Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Permira Advisers', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-16T04:20:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael J. de la Merced', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/034635a9-7658-55d9-995c-bb4baed77a4b', 'word_count': 315, 'uri': 'nyt://article/034635a9-7658-55d9-995c-bb4baed77a4b'}, {'abstract': 'The controversial proposal to replace the building in Brooklyn Heights next moves to the office of the borough president.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/16/nyregion/community-board-approves-redevelopment-plan-for-brooklyn-public-library-branch.html', 'snippet': 'The controversial proposal to replace the building in Brooklyn Heights next moves to the office of the borough president.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A controversial proposed redevelopment plan for the Brooklyn Public Library’s Brooklyn Heights branch, which includes the construction of affo