term loans, while the E.C.B. extended a line of credit for Greek banks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/17/business/international/european-central-bank-meeting-greece.html', 'snippet': 'Finance ministers agreed to proceed with bailout negotiations and provide short-term loans, while the E.C.B. extended a line of credit for Greek banks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BRUSSELS — European finance officials pledged support and money for Greece on Thursday, even as the prospects of reaching a final bailout deal were clouded by political uncertainty in Athens and German doubts about the need to preserve Greek membership in the eurozone.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/17/world/17Greekbanks-web/17Greekbanks-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 335, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/17/world/17Greekbanks-web/17Greekbanks-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 335}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/17/world/17Greekbanks-web/17Greekbanks-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 572, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/17/world/17Greekbanks-web/17Greekbanks-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1144, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/17/world/17Greekbanks-web/17Greekbanks-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/17/world/17Greekbanks-web/17Greekbanks-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/17/world/17Greekbanks-web/17Greekbanks-web-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'European Finance Officials Agree ‘in Principle’ on New Greek Bailout', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'European Finance Officials Agree &#8216;in Principle&#8217; on New Greek Bailout ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Greece', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Higgins, Andrew', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Quantitative Easing', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Central Bank', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Eurozone', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Draghi, Mario', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-16T09:11:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'International Business', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Higgins and Jack Ewing', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Higgins', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Jack', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ewing', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fa66c0d4-3f12-5a5a-bb49-56a19ec880d0', 'word_count': 1200, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fa66c0d4-3f12-5a5a-bb49-56a19ec880d0'}, {'abstract': 'Every patient presents a wide chasm of possibilities that could be nothing, something, or something horrible.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/07/16/getting-the-diagnosis-right/', 'snippet': 'Every patient presents a wide chasm of possibilities that could be nothing, something, or something horrible.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Recently I had one of those bursting-at-the-seams types of days in the clinic. Every scheduled patient showed up, plus a few extras. Everybody seemed to have burning concerns that needed immediate attention. One patient had newly diagnosed thyroid disease, but the medication was making her feel worse not better. Another was having strange twinges in his lower abdomen. One woman had been having muscle aches in her arms for the past month, and now had the same aches in her legs. Another patient was experiencing a drilling-like pain in his lower back that spread up to his neck and scalp. One man had a cough that just wouldn’t clear up. A woman was concerned because the soles of her feet felt like they were on fire. Another patient said she simply had no energy and could hardly get through her day.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/health/08well_ofri/08well_ofri-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 455, 'width': 446, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/health/08well_ofri/08well_ofri-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 455, 'width': 446, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/health/08well_ofri/08well_ofri-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/08/health/08well_ofri/08well_ofri-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/health/08well_ofri/08well_ofri-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Getting the Diagnosis Right', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doctors', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tests (Medical)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-16T09:30:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Danielle Ofri, M.D', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Danielle', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ofri', 'qualifier': 'M.D', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9dcc8e54-7944-5caa-beae-676420fd9445', 'word_count': 968, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9dcc8e54-7944-5caa-beae-676420fd9445'}, {'abstract': 'The president is intent on improving life behind bars. To make his points, he became the first sitting president to pay a visit to a federal prison.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/17/us/obama-el-reno-oklahoma-prison.html', 'snippet': 'The president is intent on improving life behind bars. To make his points, he became the first sitting president to pay a visit to a federal prison.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EL RENO, Okla. — They opened the door to Cell 123, and President Obama stared inside. In the space of 9 feet by 10 feet, he saw three bunks, a toilet with no seat, a night table with books, a small sink, prison clothes on a hook, some metal cabinets and the life he might have had.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/17/us/17OBAMAWEBSUB/17OBAMAWEBSUB-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/17/us/17OBAMAWEBSUB/17OBAMAWEBSUB-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/17/us/17OBAMAWEBSUB/17OBAMAWEBSUB-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/17/us/17OBAMAWEBSUB/17OBAMAWEBSUB-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/17/us/17OBAMAWEBSUB/17OBAMAWEBSUB-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/17/us/17OBAMAWEBSUB/17OBAMAWEBSUB-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/17/us/17OBAMAWEBSUB/17OBAMAWEBSUB-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Obama, in Oklahoma, Takes Reform Message to the Prison Cell Block', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'President Visits Federal Prison', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prisons and Prisoners', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons',