'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/644a23e6-4343-5011-9514-690c662f6fa4', 'word_count': 1287, 'uri': 'nyt://article/644a23e6-4343-5011-9514-690c662f6fa4'}, {'abstract': 'In 2007, President George W. Bush agreed to join Europeans at the negotiating table with Iran. hoping that the regime would suspend uranium activities and halt its nuclear program in exchange for economic and political benefits.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2015/07/16/george-w-bush-helped-put-u-s-on-path-to-talks-with-iran/', 'snippet': 'In 2007, President George W. Bush agreed to join Europeans at the negotiating table with Iran. hoping that the regime would suspend uranium activities and halt its nuclear program in exchange for economic and political benefits.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Republicans have been criticizing President Obama’s nuclear deal with Iran, but those with longer memories recall that it was one of their own who set the United States on the path toward negotiations.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/16/us/politics/16firstdraft-gwbush/16firstdraft-gwbush-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/16/us/politics/16firstdraft-gwbush/16firstdraft-gwbush-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/16/us/politics/16firstdraft-gwbush/16firstdraft-gwbush-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/16/us/politics/16firstdraft-gwbush/16firstdraft-gwbush-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo'