he opening performance of the inaugural program, Summer Evenings, at Alice Tully Hall was a drama-free slate of genial, lyrical pieces by Mozart, Beethoven and Schubert.', 'lead_paragraph': 'During the summer, chamber music lovers are lured to rustic barns, parks and even a wilderness grotto to hear concerts, while performers enjoy a change of scenery at festivals nationwide. And in New York, listeners have plenty of fun outdoor orchestral events to attend, although musical nuances are often drowned out by noisy picnickers and tinny amplification systems, with humidity and thunderstorms a constant threat. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: Chamber Music Society of Lincoln Center Kicks Off a Summer Series', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Sunny Program for a Seasonal Series', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schweitzer, Vivien', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lincoln Center for the Performing Arts', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Alice Tully Hall (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pohjonen, Juho', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Huang, Paul', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chamber Music Society of Lincoln Center', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-16T22:33:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vivien Schweitzer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vivien', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schweitzer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': Non