1-1fe4a301fe44'}, {'abstract': 'Viola Davis and Jennifer Lopez star in this revenge thriller, directed by Charles Stone III (“Drumline”).', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/17/movies/review-in-lila-and-eve-a-grieving-mother-turns-gun-toting-vigilante.html', 'snippet': 'Viola Davis and Jennifer Lopez star in this revenge thriller, directed by Charles Stone III (“Drumline”).', 'lead_paragraph': 'The main, and perhaps the only, reason to see the revenge thriller “Lila and Eve,” a shallow, cut-rate “Thelma and Louise,” is for the thunderous lead performance of Viola Davis. Her character, Lila, is an aggrieved mother of two sons in an Atlanta suburb who is responding to the drive-by shooting death of the older, the 18-year-old Stephon (Aml Ameen), who was college bound. Whether on the large or small screen, Ms. Davis projects an ominous gravity. Even when smiling, she always means business. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/17/arts/17LILAEVEALT/17LILAEVEALT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/17/arts/17LILAEVEALT/17LILAEVEALT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/17/arts/17LILAEVEALT/17LILAEVEALT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/17/arts/17LILAEVEALT/17LILAEVEALT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/17/arts/17LILAEVEALT/1