nce peddling by Luiz Inácio Lula da Silva.', 'lead_paragraph': 'RIO DE JANEIRO — Federal prosecutors in Brazil said Thursday that they were opening a full investigation into claims of influence peddling by Luiz Inácio Lula da Silva, the former president whose leftist Workers Party is already struggling with a sweeping graft scandal involving some of the country’s most powerful political figures.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Brazil Adds to Tally of Corruption Scandals With Investigation of a Former President', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Brazil Adds to Tally of Corruption Scandals With Investigation of a Former President', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brazil', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romero, Simon', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Da Silva, Luiz Inacio Lula', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bribery and Kickbacks', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Odebrecht SA', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corruption (Institutional)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Workers' Party (Brazil)", 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-16T23:51:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Americas', 'byline': {'original': 'By Simon Romero', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Simon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Romero', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/20bb4ba2-7698-5161-a7cf-de06f0c06a0a', 'word_count': 548, 'uri': 'nyt://article/20bb4ba2-7698-5161-a7cf-de06f0c06a0a'}, {'abstract': 'Daquan Breland was convicted of second-degree murder and Daquan Wright was convicted of second-degree criminal possession of a weapon in the death of Antiq Hennis.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/17/nyregion/2-convicted-in-2013-fatal-shooting-of-brooklyn-boy-in-a-stroller.html', 'snippet': 'Daquan Breland was convicted of second-degree murder and Daquan Wright was convicted of second-degree criminal possession of a weapon in the death of Antiq Hennis.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A man accused of opening fire on a rival in Brooklyn in 2013 and killing the rival’s 16-month-old son in his stroller was convicted of second-degree murder on Thursday, according to the Brooklyn district attorney’s office.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/17/nyregion/17guilty/17guilty-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 569, 'width': 410, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/17/nyregion/17guilty/17guilty-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 569, 'width': 410, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/17/nyregion/17guilty/17guilty-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/17/nyregion/17guilty/17guilty-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/17/nyregion/17guilty/17guilty-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '2 Convicted in 2013 Fatal Shooting of Brooklyn Boy in a Stroller', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Man Convicted