': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/18/world/europe/in-bleak-ukraine-city-a-duos-odd-experiments-win-a-niche-online.html', 'snippet': 'As Luhansk’s prospects worsened, Pavel Pavlov and Aleksandr Kryukov emerged as quirky but candid guides to a war zone, an Internet voice for locals.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LUHANSK, Ukraine — THE microwave was a loaner, left for repairs by a family that fled last year’s shelling and never came back. With a few tweaks and the judicious use of a soup can, it had been weaponized, shooting microwave rays capable of blowing up a boombox.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Bleak Ukraine City, a Duo’s Odd Experiments Win a Niche Online', 'kicker': 'The Saturday Profile', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'From Ukraine War Zone, Grab-Bag Science on YouTube', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Roth, Andrew', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kryukov, Aleksandr', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pavlov, Pavel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kreosan (YouTube Channel)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ukraine', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'YouTube.com', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings, Downloads and Streaming', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Luhansk (Ukraine)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Jehovah's Witnesses", 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-17T15:58:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Roth', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Roth', 'qualifier': N