b’s Pillow Dance Festival. Daniil Simkin’s Intensio makes its debut there with works by Alexander Ekman (Sweden), Jorma Elo (Finland), Annabelle Lopez Ochoa (Colombian-born, Belgian-based), and the New Yorker Gregory Dolbashian. Mr. Simkin, a dancing whirlwind from American Ballet Theater, says that his troupe, drawn from Ballet Theater and Les Ballets Jazz de Montréal, takes its name from a linguistic union of “intention” and “intensity.” So expect energy. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/19/arts/19WEEK6/19WEEK6-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1125, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/19/arts/19WEEK6/19WEEK6-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1125}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/19/arts/19WEEK6/19WEEK6-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 547, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/19/arts/19WEEK6/19WEEK6-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1093, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/19/arts/19WEEK6/19WEEK6-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/19/arts/19WEEK6/19WEEK6-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/19/arts/19WEEK6/19WEEK6-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'New York, French Canadian and German Energy at Jacob’s Pillow', 'kicker': 'Dance', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fully Intending to Be Intense', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': "Jacob's Pillow Dance Festival", 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMERICAN BALLET THEATER', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Les Ballets Jazz de Montreal', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-17T16:00:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jack Anderson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jack', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Anderson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d178bc93-8324-52ef-86fd-31a1bd1710f0', 'word_count': 120, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d178bc93-8324-52ef-86fd-31a1bd1710f0'}, {'abstract': 'The new cookbook offers 90 inventive recipes, but it’s the 10 vegan variations that make it stand out.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/22/dining/cookbook-review-van-leeuwen-artisan-ice-cream-by-ben-van-leeuwen.html', 'snippet': 'The new cookbook offers 90 inventive recipes, but it’s the 10 vegan variations that make it stand out.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you’re the kind of ice cream lover who thinks the more butterfat and egg yolks in a pint the better, you’ll be tempted to skip the vegan chapter of the new “Van Leeuwen Artisan Ice Cream” cookbook (Ecco, 2015). Why contemplate vegan roasted banana ice cream when there is a recipe for the original dairy-rich version 60 pages earlier?', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/22/dining/22COOKBOOK5/22COOKBOOK5-a