'}, {'abstract': 'Despite derision in social media, the one-day sale appeared to achieve the company’s goals: more sales, and a big bump in subscribers to its Amazon Prime service.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/18/business/amazon-says-prime-day-outdid-black-friday-in-unit-sales.html', 'snippet': 'Despite derision in social media, the one-day sale appeared to achieve the company’s goals: more sales, and a big bump in subscribers to its Amazon Prime service.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Despite a much-derided  product lineup and clunky wait-lists, Amazon said on Friday that it sold more products during its Prime Day sale this week than Black Friday last year, and that more new members tried its Prime subscription service than on any single day in the retailer’s 20-year history.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/18/business/18AMAZONsub/18AMAZONsub-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 306, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/18/business/18AMAZONsub/18AMAZONsub-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 306}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/18/business/18AMAZONsub/18AMAZONsub-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 522, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/18/business/18AMAZONsub/18AMAZONsub-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1044, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/18/business/18AMAZONsub/18AMAZONsub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStan