a4'}, {'abstract': 'Images from the NASA mission show a mixed bag of terrains, including ice mountains and smooth plains crisscrossed by enigmatic troughs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/18/science/space/pluto-terrain-yields-big-surprises-in-new-horizons-images.html', 'snippet': 'Images from the NASA mission show a mixed bag of terrains, including ice mountains and smooth plains crisscrossed by enigmatic troughs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In addition to soaring ice mountains, Pluto’s mixed bag of terrains includes smooth plains that are crisscrossed by enigmatic troughs, photographs from NASA’s New Horizons mission show.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/18/science/17Pluto/17Pluto-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 332, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/18/science/17Pluto/17Pluto-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 332}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/18/science/17Pluto/17Pluto-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 566, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/18/science/17Pluto/17Pluto-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1109, 'width': 2005, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/18/science/17Pluto/17Pluto-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/18/science/17Pluto/17Pluto-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credi