r Gays in Workplace Discrimination', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality and Bisexuality', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Workplace Environment', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Equal Employment Opportunity Commission', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hiring and Promotion', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civil Rights and Liberties', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-18T00:56:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Noam Scheiber', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Noam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Scheiber', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/089a64d2-3fe5-58aa-83e9-8b547ab461cb', 'word_count': 1122, 'uri': 'nyt://article/089a64d2-3fe5-58aa-83e9-8b547ab461cb'}, {'abstract': 'Physical fitness is not the problem. The corps’ culture is.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/18/opinion/the-real-barrier-for-women-marines.html', 'snippet': 'Physical fitness is not the problem. The corps’ culture is.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IN her role as leader of the Marine Corps’ all-women boot camp at Parris Island, S.C., Lt. Col. Kate Germano was known as a demanding and at times blunt commander. She was also effective. Under her leadership, performance in physical fitness and rifle tests improved significantly, and so did retention rates for female recruits. Colonel Germano drove her recruits based on the belief that women would not be taken seriously as Marines until they could meet the same performance standards as men. That belief is widespread, and it is ingrained in Marine culture.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/18/opinion/18Ackerman/18Ackerman-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1026, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/18/opinion/18Ackerman/18Ackerman-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1026}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/18/opinion/18Ackerman/18Ackerman-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 599, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/18/opinion/18Ackerman/18Ackerman-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1198, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/18/opinion/18Ackerman/18Ackerman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/18/opinion/18Ackerman/18Ackerman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/18/opinion/18Ackerman/18Ackerman-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Real Barrier for Women Marines', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Real Barrier for Women Marines', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}