firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schuessler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e3ac9e0c-2fa1-59e7-bf61-4d57beb4e8f7', 'word_count': 166, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e3ac9e0c-2fa1-59e7-bf61-4d57beb4e8f7'}, {'abstract': 'Baseball is deep into an analytics period, but there is still charm to the game, and a lot of it can be found in an unprecedented wave of raw talent.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/18/opinion/stars-on-baseballs-horizon.html', 'snippet': 'Baseball is deep into an analytics period, but there is still charm to the game, and a lot of it can be found in an unprecedented wave of raw talent.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After three billion miles and nearly 10 years of travel, the New Horizons spacecraft has finally flown by Pluto. When it first left Earth, I was wrapping up 15 seasons of professional baseball, completing my fight to hold on to my job and health, as the next generation of players ushered aging veterans out of the game.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/10/04/opinion/Glanville-contributor/Glanville-contributor-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 242, 'width': 203, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/10/04/opinion/Glanville-contributor/Glanville-contributor-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 242, 'width': 203, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/10/04/opinion/Glanville-contributor/Glanville-contributor-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/