z, sent hours before his rampage, and was expanding an inquiry into his 2014 trip to Jordan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/19/us/chattanooga-attacks-claim-a-5th-military-service-members-life.html', 'snippet': 'The F.B.I. was reviewing a text that the gunman, Mohammod Abdulazeez, sent hours before his rampage, and was expanding an inquiry into his 2014 trip to Jordan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHATTANOOGA, Tenn. — The F.B.I. is reviewing a text message that the gunman who opened fire on two military facilities here sent to a friend hours before his rampage, a law enforcement official said Saturday. That text, which might provide insight into the gunman’s motivation, included a link to an Islamic verse saying, “Whosoever shows enmity to a friend of Mine, then I have declared war against him.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/19/us/19CHATTANOOGA/19CHATTANOOGA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/19/us/19CHATTANOOGA/19CHATTANOOGA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/19/us/19CHATTANOOGA/19CHATTANOOGA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/19/us/19CHATTANOOGA/19CHATTANOOGA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/19/us/19CHATTANOOGA/19CHATTANOOGA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 't