7-97db-69d35d0cf82b'}, {'abstract': 'A 45-year-old specialist with the National Intelligence Service who was found dead in his car left a note denying his team spied on South Korean citizens, the police said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/20/world/asia/in-suicide-note-south-korea-hacking-expert-denies-domestic-spying.html', 'snippet': 'A 45-year-old specialist with the National Intelligence Service who was found dead in his car left a note denying his team spied on South Korean citizens, the police said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SEOUL, South Korea — A hacking specialist at South Korea’s National Intelligence Service who was found dead left a suicide note denying that his team spied on South Korean citizens’ cellphone or other online communications, the police said on Sunday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Suicide Note, South Korea Hacking Expert Denies Domestic Spying', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'World Briefing | Asia; South Korea: Agent’s Suicide Note Contains Denial of Domestic Spying', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Korea', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Surveillance of Citizens by Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cyberattacks and Hackers', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suicides and Suicide Attempts', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hacking Team SRL', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Intelligence Service (South Korea)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Espionage and Intelligence Services', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Park Geun-hye', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-19T11:03:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World