le/e8b97618-2868-56c4-bdd2-0182b112a899'}, {'abstract': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Russian and Austro-German troops clash in 1915.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/07/19/1915-russians-gain-great-success-over-austrians-on-dniester/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Russian and Austro-German troops clash in 1915.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Fighting is in progress along practically the entire Russian front, extending for a thousand miles from the Baltic to the Bukowina. Despite the activity of the enemy in Courland and on the Narew front, the Germans’ great effort is apparently being made between the Vistula and the Bug, immediately south of the Lublin-Kholm railway, where General von Mackensen has been rapidly accumulating reinforcements during the recent lull in the fighting and now disposes of armies amounting to almost 2,000,000 men. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1915: Russians Gain Success Against Austro-German Onslaught', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World War I (1914-18)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Poland', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-19T13:33:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ee8bcbd5-e2f6-57fb-86dc-2cbe3ea74717', 'word_count': 217, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ee8bcbd5-e2f6-57fb-86dc-2cbe3ea74717'}, {'abstract': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Italy planned to move into Syria in 1940.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/07/19/1940-italy-sending-mission-to-syria-to-disband-the-french/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Italy planned to move into Syria in 1940.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ATHENS — Italy, it was learned here tonight [July 19], is making the final arrangements to dispatch a military mission to Syria to arrange there details of the demobilization of the French Army of the Near East, which is under the command of Gen. Eugene Mittelhauser. In some quarters it is thought that the disclosure that Rome is taking this step may prove the signal for some action by the British forces in the eastern Mediterranean calculated to insure that Syria shall not be left in a position to serve as a potential base for enemy operations. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/20/blogs/20iht-old1940/20iht-old1940-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 384, 'width': 272, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/20/blogs/20iht-old1940/20iht-old1940-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 384, 'width': 272, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/20/blogs/20iht-old1940/20iht-old1940-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/20/blogs/20iht-old1940/20iht-old1940-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/20/blogs/20i