where Mohammod Abdulazeez killed the five servicemen in a bloody rampage Thursday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/20/us/chattanooga-wears-pride-beside-its-pain-after-killings.html', 'snippet': 'The expression of patriotism and pride was the most visible emotion during the weekend in Chattanooga, Tenn., where Mohammod Abdulazeez killed the five servicemen in a bloody rampage Thursday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHATTANOOGA, Tenn. — The American flags are everywhere here: fluttering behind big pickup trucks and choppers growling across the freeways, at half-staff at the McDonald’s across the street from the bullet-riddled military recruitment center, and planted, in a long, straight line, in the grass near the place where four Marines and a Navy seaman were fatally shot.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/20/us/20CHATTANOOGA-jp/20CHATTANOOGA-jp-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/20/us/20CHATTANOOGA-jp/20CHATTANOOGA-jp-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/20/us/20CHATTANOOGA-jp/20CHATTANOOGA-jp-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/20/us/20CHATTANOOGA-jp/20CHATTANOOGA-jp-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/20/us/20CHATTANOOGA-jp/20CHATTANOOGA-jp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_na