oot of ocean landscapes, Joni Sternbach refocused her camera on surfers to create tin-type portraits.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/07/20/finding-stillness-in-surfer-portraits/', 'snippet': 'After an overcast day disrupted her shoot of ocean landscapes, Joni Sternbach refocused her camera on surfers to create tin-type portraits.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Surf pictures are traditionally studies in motion — a figure in the spray of a cutback or under the curl of a jewel-toned barrel. But Joni Sternbach, who has spent the last nine years making large-format tintype photographs of surfers on beaches around the globe, is after something different: a kind of ethnographic study in stillness, silvery portraits of a tribe united by a sense of adventure, the love of a sport and a connection to the ocean.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Capturing the Stillness of Surfers in Portraits', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Surfing', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sternbach, Joni (Photographer)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-20T07:00:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By Diane Cardwell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Diane', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cardwell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f0c7fcf8-0c45-5e1b-8da7-0069990fb421', 'word_count': 581, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f0c7fcf8-0c45-5e1b-8da7-0069990fb421'}, {'abstract': 'Girls Inc. writes that pregnancy prevention is critical to keeping students in school.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/20/opinion/reducing-teenage-births.html'