ord_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/2593a802-b673-5766-b97f-1071794ace40'}, {'abstract': 'Some critics have assailed The Sun for publishing a video of the salute, but others have commended it for prodding a historical reckoning.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/21/world/europe/royal-familys-nazi-salute-in-1930s-stirs-debate-in-britain.html', 'snippet': 'Some critics have assailed The Sun for publishing a video of the salute, but others have commended it for prodding a historical reckoning.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — The grainy black-and-white home movie lasts about 17 seconds. It shows a young Princess Elizabeth, the future Queen Elizabeth II, raising her hand in the air in the style of a Nazi salute, an apparent youthful pantomime. The queen mother and Elizabeth’s uncle, Prince Edward, who would become King Edward VIII, also make the gesture.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/21/world/QUEEN/QUEEN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 745, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/21/world/QUEEN/QUEEN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 745}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/21/world/QUEEN/QUEEN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 825, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/21/world/QUEEN/QUEEN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1641, 'width': 1322, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/21/world/QUEEN/QUEEN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbSta