-landlord-learned-about-me-from-twitter.html', 'snippet': 'Apartment hunting in the age of social media.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last July, I sat at my desk in my Toronto apartment and made my case for an American company to hire me. I had never wanted anything as badly as I wanted that job, and when the email finally arrived, I proceeded to lie facedown on my wooden floor, my nose pressed to the cold surface, too overwhelmed to move.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/10/magazine/10mag-apartments-2/10mag-apartments-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 638, 'width': 478, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/10/magazine/10mag-apartments-2/10mag-apartments-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 638, 'width': 478, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/10/magazine/10mag-apartments-2/10mag-apartments-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/10/magazine/10mag-apartments-2/10mag-apartments-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/10/magazine/10mag-apartments-2/10mag-apartments-2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What My Landlord Learned About Me From Twitter', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subje