terans-groups-take-their-shots-at-trump-as-he-backs-off-a-bit-on-mccain.html', 'snippet': 'Donald J. Trump faces a barrage of criticism himself over his own commitment to veterans causes as well as the propriety of attacking a former prisoner of war honored as a hero.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Of the many offenses Senator John McCain has committed in the eyes of his most ardent conservative critics — supporting an immigration overhaul, for example, or more recently calling some of them “crazies” — a poor record on veterans’ issues is not one that has ever come up. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Veterans’ Groups Take Their Shots at Donald Trump as He Backs Off a Bit on McCain', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Veterans&#8217; Groups Take Their Shots at Trump as He Backs Off a Bit on McCain', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Peters, Jeremy W', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Veterans', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCain, John', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-21T01:09:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeremy W. Peters', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeremy', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Peters', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9f23b9ce-fabf-5363-aea1-564d13e47778', 'word_count': 1053, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9f23b9ce-fabf-5363-aea1-564d13e47778'}, {'abstract': 'The injured third baseman Wright has found a new way to make his presence felt. “He always knows the right thing to say and do,” reliever Bobby Parnell said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/21/sports/baseball/a-test-and-texts-for-the-mets-with-david-wright-out.html', 'snippet': 'The injured third baseman Wright has found a new way to make his presence felt. “He always knows the right thing to say and do,” reliever Bobby Parnell said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — In early June, Eric Campbell singled home a run to give the Mets the lead in a game they eventually lost, 7-2, to the Arizona Diamondbacks. It was the type of play easily forgotten over the course of the six-month season. But for Campbell, a nondescript reserve, the hit ended an 0-for-28 slump. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/21/sports/Y-WRIGHT-1/Y-WRIGHT-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/21/sports/Y-WRIGHT-1/Y-WRIGHT-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/21/sports/Y-WRIGHT-1/Y-WRIGHT-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/21/sports/Y-WRIGHT-1/Y-WRIGHT-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/21/sports/Y-WRIGHT-1/Y-WRIGHT-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/21/sports/Y-WRIGHT-1/Y-WRIGHT-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidt