 'uri': 'nyt://article/711a2042-79d7-5e94-aa87-f180903d739c'}, {'abstract': 'Three workers are responsible for the 39 flags on the stadium’s roof, including the pennants of the 30 major league teams, which must be arranged in the order of the division standings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/22/sports/baseball/an-up-and-down-season-at-yankee-stadium-at-least-for-the-flag-crew.html', 'snippet': 'Three workers are responsible for the 39 flags on the stadium’s roof, including the pennants of the 30 major league teams, which must be arranged in the order of the division standings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Early in the afternoon on many spring, summer and fall days, two men — sometimes three — hike to the top row of the upper deck at Yankee Stadium, where the oxygen begins to thin. They climb a 20-foot ladder and squeeze through a portal in the roof that is no bigger than Brett Gardner’s strike zone. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'An Up-and-Down Season at Yankee Stadium, at Least for the Flag Crew', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ups and Downs Typify This Crew&#8217;s Season ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Witz, Billy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Yankee Stadium (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Flags, Emblems and Insignia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-21T09:00:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Billy Witz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Billy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Witz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'ran