ne, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/29f541bc-bec5-5ad8-bb9a-9c7e9881cbaf', 'word_count': 990, 'uri': 'nyt://article/29f541bc-bec5-5ad8-bb9a-9c7e9881cbaf'}, {'abstract': 'Katy Esquivel, whose video blog has more than a million subscribers, likes to film among the vivid colonial buildings in a bohemian neighborhood in Lima.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/23/fashion/a-fashion-blogger-with-a-colorful-peruvian-backdrop.html', 'snippet': 'Katy Esquivel, whose video blog has more than a million subscribers, likes to film among the vivid colonial buildings in a bohemian neighborhood in Lima.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Barranco neighborhood in Lima, Peru, where colorful colonial buildings are coated with even more vibrant bougainvillea flowers, offers a bohemian escape from the city’s noisy traffic-stalled streets. “A lot of artists, writers, singers or any kind of people who like to perform or do creative things live here because the place gets you really inspired,” said Katy Esquivel, whose “What the Chic” video blog has more than a million subscribers. She was recently in the area wearing a matching floral print top and shorts with an orange clutch and a watch that is a family heirloom. “Me as a blogger, it is one of my favorite places to film because it complements my outfits,” Ms. Esquivel said. (This interview has been edited and condensed.)', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Fashion Blogger With a Colorful Peruvian Backdrop', 'kicker': 'Intersection', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Passing Peru With Flying Colors', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Esquivel, Katy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Lima (Peru)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'YouTube.com', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blogs and Blogging (Internet)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings, Downloads and Streaming', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-21T09:48:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Oresti Tsonopoulos', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Oresti', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tsonopoulos', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2f949f45-f489-50ec-bbb4-09449045c8e0', 'word_count': 269, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2f949f45-f489-50ec-bbb4-09449045c8e0'}, {'abstract': 'The $284 million investment in Piramal Realty is the private equity firm’s fifth investment in India in less than a year.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/22/business/dealbook/warburg-pincus-to-take-stake-in-indian-developer.html', 'snippet': 'The $284 million investment in Piramal Realty is the private equity firm’s fifth investment in India in less than a year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The private equity firm Warburg Pincus is set to make another big move into India by taking a stake in a real estate developer backed by one of the country’s major conglomerates.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Warburg Pincus to Take Stake in Indian Developer', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'India Move', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Warburg Pincus', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de la Merced, Michael J', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Piramal Enterprises Ltd', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank'