 the average Republican says,” he wrote, “they really don’t have anything at all to say that’s worth hearing.” This week, he discussed some of those candidates on the Times Insider podcast. He noted that Mr. Trump had seen some fallout from his comments about Mexican immigrants, with Univision and others severing their ties with him. “It’s possible that Donald Trump will worry about losing business,” Mr. Rosenthal said. “On the other hand, this is who he is.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/21/opinion/21trumpWEB/21trumpWEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/21/opinion/21trumpWEB/21trumpWEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/21/opinion/21trumpWEB/21trumpWEB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/21/opinion/21trumpWEB/21trumpWEB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/21/opinion/21trumpWEB/21trumpWEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/21/opinion/21trumpWEB/21trumpWEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/21/opinion/21trumpWEB/21trumpWEB-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge',