eechless.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s on TV Wednesday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What&#8217;s On TV Wednesday', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-22T05:00:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kathryn Shattuck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kathryn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shattuck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/a122c78d-9437-5b38-9f28-b52fa86a105c', 'word_count': 715, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a122c78d-9437-5b38-9f28-b52fa86a105c'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the Day for Wednesday, July 22, 2015.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/22/pageoneplus/quotation-of-the-day.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the Day for Wednesday, July 22, 2015.', 'lead_paragraph': '“It is designed to break a man’s will to live.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2015-07-22T05:41:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/58eae82d-d226-577a-afc6-eb35e8051e8b', 'word_count': 27, 'uri': 'nyt://article/58eae82d-d226-577a-afc6-eb35e8051e8b'}, {'abstract': 'Corrections appearing in print on Wednesday, July 22, 2015.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/22/pageoneplus/corrections-july-22-2