, 'uri': 'nyt://article/df606a27-42ae-5ee3-a14e-090b3f4e8752'}, {'abstract': 'A Natural Resources Defense Council official says we can’t rely on regulations to reduce the negative effects of fracking.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/22/opinion/clean-energy-not-fracking.html', 'snippet': 'A Natural Resources Defense Council official says we can’t rely on regulations to reduce the negative effects of fracking.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To the Editor:', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Clean Energy, Not Fracking', 'kicker': 'Letter', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Clean Energy, Not Fracking', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hydraulic Fracturing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Alternative and Renewable Energy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-22T07:21:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Letters', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/4cf58f79-1c48-5532-b982-30c90079b40f', 'word_count': 211, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4cf58f79-1c48-5532-b982-30c90079b40f'}, {'abstract': 'Senator Bernie Sanders’s financial transaction tax would raise revenue and discourage high-frequency trading.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/22/opinion/the-case-for-a-tax-on-financial-transactions.html', 'snippet': 'Senator Bernie Sanders’s financial transaction tax would raise revenue and discourage high-frequency trading.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — LIKE it or not, the campaign season is upon us, and that almost certainly means somebody is going to try to buy your vote with a tax cut — even though average federal tax rates are already low in historical terms, our tax code remains