8cd87f-ab6f-52a3-8d2e-48bc14c1a411'}, {'abstract': 'A big step toward reforming the politicized and dysfunctional two-state authority lacks only the approval of New Jersey lawmakers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/22/opinion/cleaning-up-the-port-authority.html', 'snippet': 'A big step toward reforming the politicized and dysfunctional two-state authority lacks only the approval of New Jersey lawmakers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The bizarre traffic jam engineered two years ago at the George Washington Bridge by an associate of Gov. Chris Christie of New Jersey provided dramatic evidence that the Port Authority of New York and New Jersey was badly in need of an overhaul. The authority controls the airports, tunnels, bridges and other facilities essential to the regional economy. Over the years it has become politicized and dysfunctional.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/22/opinion/22wed3web/22wed3web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 409, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/22/opinion/22wed3web/22wed3web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 409}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/22/opinion/22wed3web/22wed3web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 698, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/22/opinion/22wed3web/22wed3web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1396, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/22/opinion/22wed3web/22wed3web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType