 New York days after the Supreme Court legalized same-sex unions. Those protections will fade away, however, when they return home to Ukraine.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/23/nyregion/a-public-vow-of-love-doubling-as-an-act-of-defiance.html', 'snippet': 'Taras Karasiichuk and Mykola Maslov married in New York days after the Supreme Court legalized same-sex unions. Those protections will fade away, however, when they return home to Ukraine.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dressed in flashy suits, custom made to match the blue and yellow of the Ukrainian flag, Taras Karasiichuk and Mykola Maslov stood before a clerk at the Manhattan marriage bureau on July 1 and spoke their wedding vows.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Public Vow of Love, Doubling as an Act of Defiance', 'kicker': 'Summer Love', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Vow of Love Doubles as a Public Act of Defiance', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Series', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ukraine', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dating and Relationships', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Maslov, Mykola', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Karasiichuk, Taras', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality and Bisexuality', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-22T17:05:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Sc