band Nickel Creek, are releasing a record with a heavyweight supporting cast.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/26/arts/music/sean-and-sara-watkins-celebrate-a-debut-album-watkins-family-hour.html', 'snippet': 'These siblings, best known as two-thirds of the bluegrass band Nickel Creek, are releasing a record with a heavyweight supporting cast.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sean and Sara Watkins have been known for most of their lives as two-thirds of Nickel Creek, the expansive, pop-literate bluegrass band. But since 2002, they have also parlayed their sibling chemistry into the Watkins Family Hour —\xa0a residency at the Los Angeles club Largo, anchored by Mr. Watkins on flatpicking acoustic guitar, Ms. Watkins on fiddle, and a heavyweight supporting cast including the singer Fiona Apple and the keyboardist Benmont Tench. To celebrate the release of its oak-solid debut album, “Watkins Family Hour” (Family Hour/Thirty Tigers), the whole crew will settle in Tuesday through Thursday at City Winery, with guest vocalists including Tift Merritt, Michael Daves and Ashley Monroe. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/26/arts/26GUIDE6/26GUIDE6-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 491, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/26/arts/26GUIDE6/26GUIDE6-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 491}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/26/arts/26GUIDE6/26GUIDE6-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 839, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/26/arts/26GUIDE6/26GUIDE6-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1677, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJ