 'lead_paragraph': 'The trees started rustling ominously, and the sky darkened as the Orpheus Chamber Orchestra performed the first movement Presto of Haydn’s Symphony No. 1, a sense of urgency reflected in its bristling rendition at the Naumburg Bandshell on Tuesday evening. A few drops fell during the lilting Andante, and a handful of umbrellas sprouted amid the large crowd of listeners. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/23/arts/23ORPHEUS/23ORPHEUS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 376, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/23/arts/23ORPHEUS/23ORPHEUS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 376}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/23/arts/23ORPHEUS/23ORPHEUS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 642, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/23/arts/23ORPHEUS/23ORPHEUS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1283, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/23/arts/23ORPHEUS/23ORPHEUS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/23/arts/23ORPHEUS/23ORPHEUS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/23/arts/23ORPHEUS/23ORPHEUS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: Orpheus Chamber Orchestra Gets Personal in Central Park', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Up Close and Personal in the Park', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schweitzer, Vivien', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Central Park (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Naumburg Bandshell (Central Park)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Orpheus Chamber Orchestra', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-22T21:54:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vivien Schweitzer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vivien', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schweitzer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/db9e6584-9892-593d-b4a8-82406f692797', 'word_count': 314, 'uri': 'nyt://article/db9e6584-9892-593d-b4a8-82406f692797'}, {'abstract': 'The documentary about Ms. Jenner is a challenge for Bunim/Murray Productions, the company best known for the freewheeling antics of “Keeping Up With the Kardashians.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/23/arts/television/with-caitlyn-jenners-new-show-a-reality-producer-tries-to-tame-the-antics.html', 'snippet': 'The documentary about Ms. Jenner is a challenge for Bunim/Murray Productions, the company best known for the freewheeling antics of “Keeping Up With the Kardashians.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — “I Am Cait,” the new E! reality series starring Caitlyn Jenner, begins at 4:32 a.m. with Ms. Jenner wide-awake. Looking exhausted, she stares into a camera and agonizes over the stress in becoming a sudden role model for transg