id they had seen no signs of depression.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/23/us/sandra-blands-family-says-video-sheds-no-light-on-reason-for-her-arrest.html', 'snippet': 'Sandra Bland, who was found hanging in a jail cell, told officials that she tried last year to kill herself, a sheriff said. But her family said they had seen no signs of depression.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HEMPSTEAD, Tex. — A 28-year-old woman whose arrest this month during a traffic stop ended with her hanging death in a county jail cell told officials that she tried last year to kill herself, the Texas sheriff who oversees the jail said on Wednesday. But the jailers did not put her on suicide watch, and her family’s lawyer said that relatives had no evidence that she had ever tried to commit suicide or struggled with depression.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Dispute Over Sandra Bland’s Mental State Follows Death in a Texas Jail', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': ' Dispute Over Woman&#8217;s Mental State Follows Death in a Texas Jail', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bland, Sandra (1987-2015)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Encinia, Brian T (1985- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suicides and Suicide Attempts', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Texas', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prisons and Prisoners', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Waller County (Tex)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Smith, R Glenn', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-22T22:33:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Da