'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-22T23:40:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alex Williams', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alex', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Williams', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c1bd45bb-6c76-5678-9381-fa7b98db6f3f', 'word_count': 644, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c1bd45bb-6c76-5678-9381-fa7b98db6f3f'}, {'abstract': 'Find relief from the heat at the Dover Street Market New Beginning, and check out collaborations from Alexa Chung and Garance Doré.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/23/fashion/shopping-events-and-sales-happening-this-week-in-new-york.html', 'snippet': 'Find relief from the heat at the Dover Street Market New Beginning, and check out collaborations from Alexa Chung and Garance Doré.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Escape from the heat at the Dover Street Market New Beginning, the fashion emporium’s biannual seasonal changeover, when pieces from brand-new lines are added to its roster. Those include an Alyx zip boot ($825) by the onetime Kanye West creative director Matthew Williams and Saturn earrings by the French jewelry designer Charlotte Chesnais. The earrings have interlocking circles inspired by the planet’s rings ($550). At 160 Lexington Avenue. … On Thursday, the ’70s-inspired accessories label Madison Harding will open a weeklong pop-up in NoLIta, where you’ll find cute vintagey bits like a whipstitch-edged pouch ($65) and calf-suede covered platforms ($165) as well as Me and You cotton tees ($48) and signed copies of Petra Collins’s book “Babe” ($29.95). At 252 Mott Street. … On Friday from 11 a.m. to 6 p.m., and every Friday for the rest of the summer, Into the Gloss will host Summer Fridays at Glossier, where you can shop the full range of products from the beauty blog’s in-house line, like Coconut Balm Dotcom skin salve ($12), and chill out in an “Escape Room” installation by the artist Grace Villamil. Bonus: Juice Press is on tap. At 123 Lafayette Street, penthouse.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/23/fashion/23scout1/23scout1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 654, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/23/fashion/23scout1/23scout1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 654}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/23/fashion/23scout1/23scout1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 939, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/23/fashion/23scout1/23scout1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1878, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/23/fashion/23scout1/23scout1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/23/fashion/23scout1/23scout1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/23/fashion/23scout1/23scout1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Shopping Events and Sales Happening This Week in New York', 'kicker': 'Scouting Report', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shoes and Boots', 'rank': 1, 'major': '