'Men’s Fashion Week Gives Homegrown Talent Its Due    ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': "Men's Fashion Week", 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New York Fashion Week', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kors, Michael', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Varvatos, John', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-22T23:53:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Men’s Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Guy Trebay', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Guy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Trebay', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1e2f5dac-92e9-5376-b303-dc5bc7b2ac33', 'word_count': 782, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1e2f5dac-92e9-5376-b303-dc5bc7b2ac33'}, {'abstract': 'Fiat Chrysler is recalling about 350,000 Journey sport utility vehicles because a plastic engine cover could come loose, contact a hot exhaust and cause a fire.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/23/business/fire-risk-prompts-fiat-chrysler-to-recall-350000-vehicles.html', 'snippet': 'Fiat Chrysler is recalling about 350,000 Journey sport utility vehicles because a plastic engine cover could come loose, contact a hot exhaust and cause a fire.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Fiat Chrysler is recalling about 350,000 Journey sport utility vehicles, including about 144,000 in the United States, because a plastic engine cover could come loose, contact a hot exhaust and cause a fire, the automaker said on Wednesday. Three fires in Chile resulting in one “minor” injury prompted the automaker’s investigation, a spokesman for Chrysler, Eric Mayne, said in an email. He said eight vehicles in the United States have had the problem, but while there was heat damage, there were no fires. The recalled vehicles are the four-cylinder models of the 2011-15 Dodge Journey, and a sibling sold outside North America as the Fiat Fremont. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Fire Risk Prompts Fiat Chrysler to Recall 350,000 Vehicles', 'kicker': 'Business Briefing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fire Risk Prompts Fiat Chrysler to Recall 350,000 Vehicles', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jensen, Christopher', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fiat Chrysler Automobiles NV', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recalls and Bans of Products', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobile Safety Features and Defects', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chile', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-22T23:58:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christopher Jensen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christopher', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jensen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/6686cf37-dad4-5184-87eb-dca62288ea8e', 'word_count': 106, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6686cf37-dad4-5184-87eb-dca62288ea8e'}, {'abstract': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Sir Alec Douglas-Home steps down as Tory leader in 1965.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/07/22/1965-home-resigns-as-tory-leader/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Sir Alec Douglas-Home steps down as Tory leader in 1965.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON— In a surprise move, Sir Alec Douglas-Home today stepped down as leader of the opposition Conservative party. The likeliest successor to the 62- year-old Sir Alec, who was prime minister for a year, is one of two younger men — Edward (Ted) Heath, 49, or Reginald Maudling, 48. Sir Alec’s resignation gives the go-ahead to the Conservatives to be an up-to-date, hard-hitting organization open to all classes. Mr. Heath and Mr. Maudling never went to Eton or other fancy prep schools and are immune from the charge that only the rich run the Conservative organization. — New York Herald Tribune, European Edition, July 23, 1965', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/23/blogs/23iht-oldjuly23-tory/23iht-oldjuly23-tory-jumbo.png', 'height': 734, 'width': 440, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/23/blogs/23iht-oldjuly23-tory/23iht-oldjuly23-tory-superJumbo.png', 'height': 734, 'width': 440, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/23/blogs/23iht-oldjuly23-tory/23iht-oldjuly23-tory-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/23/blogs/23iht-oldjuly23-tory/23iht-oldjuly23-tory-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/23/blogs/23iht-oldjuly23-tory/23iht-oldjuly23-tory-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1965: Home Resigns as Tory Leader', 'kicker': 'IHT 