ce in the top 10 “of an average of the five most recent national polls as recognized by Fox News” as of 5 p.m. on Aug. 4th.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2015/07/22/fox-news-memo-details-qualifying-guidelines-for-the-first-presidential-debate/', 'snippet': 'The memo says that in order to make the cut for the debate on Aug. 6, each candidate must, among other things, place in the top 10 “of an average of the five most recent national polls as recognized by Fox News” as of 5 p.m. on Aug. 4th.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the Republican Party frets about how Donald Trump could affect its first presidential debate, each of the 16 presidential campaigns on Wednesday received critical guidelines from Fox News, the cable channel that will host and broadcast the August 6 debate.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/22/us/politics/22firstdraft-debate/22firstdraft-debate-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/22/us/politics/22firstdraft-debate/22firstdraft-debate-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/22/us/politics/22firstdraft-debate/22firstdraft-debate-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/22/us/politics/22firstdraft-debate/22firstdraft-debate-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/22/us/politics/22firstdraft-debate/22firstdraft-debate-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height':