e54fbddc9'}, {'abstract': 'Mayor Bill de Blasio has made headway with creating affordable housing in New York City, but the road ahead may be harder.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/23/opinion/a-city-for-the-poor-rich-and-in-between.html', 'snippet': 'Mayor Bill de Blasio has made headway with creating affordable housing in New York City, but the road ahead may be harder.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A year and a half into his mayoralty, it’s now Bill de Blasio’s New York. So is the city starting to look like the one he promised to build, one where the poor and the working class can afford to live?', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/23/opinion/23thur1/23thur1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 746, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/23/opinion/23thur1/23thur1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 746}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/23/opinion/23thur1/23thur1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 824, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/23/opinion/23thur1/23thur1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1200, 'width': 965, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/23/opinion/23thur1/23thur1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/23/opinion/23thur1/23thur1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 