 considered inappropriate. Now it has become a routine part of my practice.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/07/23/shopping-for-a-doctor-who-fits/', 'snippet': 'Decades ago, when physicians worked within a much more paternalistic system, “doctor shopping” by patients would have been considered inappropriate. Now it has become a routine part of my practice.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I had already been given a head’s up about my next patient by one of our schedulers. The notes next to her name in the electronic medical record read, “New consult, switching care, patient preference. Do not cancel any other appointments until this one is completed.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Shopping for a Doctor Who ‘Fits’', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doctors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-23T16:01:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mikkael A. Sekeres, M.d', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mikkael', 'middlename': 'A.', 'lastname': 'Sekeres', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7f4eb564-2d75-5062-b450-278b79971c1c', 'word_count': 807, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7f4eb564-2d75-5062-b450-278b79971c1c'}, {'abstract': 'As more details are released on the death of a 28-year-old black woman in a Texas jail, curiosity has mounted over the circumstances. Here is what we know about what happened to Sandra Bland.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2015/07/23/us/23blandlisty.html', 'snippet': 'As more details are released on the death of a 28-year-old black woma