49'}, {'abstract': 'A drooling wombat is the face of a solo show performed by the longest-serving zookeeper at the National Zoo in Washington.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/07/23/behind-the-poster-wombat-drool/', 'snippet': 'A drooling wombat is the face of a solo show performed by the longest-serving zookeeper at the National Zoo in Washington.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Last year, after 39 years of lemurs and moonrats, David S. Kessler retired as the longest-serving zookeeper at the National Zoo in Washington. This summer Mr. Kessler turned his wisdom about small mammals and his longtime love of theater into “Wombat Drool,” a semi-autobiographical show in which he plays a zookeeper giving a slide-show presentation about wombats and other underappreciated animals. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/22/theater/22wombat/22wombat-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 462, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/22/theater/22wombat/22wombat-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 462}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/22/theater/22wombat/22wombat-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 788, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/22/theater/22wombat/22wombat-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1263, 'width': 1641, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/22/theater/22wombat/22wombat-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/22/theater/22