sandra-blands-arrest-stirs-reader-reaction/', 'snippet': 'Video of Sandra Bland’s arrest, which was followed three days later by her death, has stirred many Times readers to react and share their own experiences with traffic stops.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Marie Tae McDermott is a news assistant and comment moderator.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sandra Bland’s Arrest Stirs Reader Reaction', 'kicker': 'Times Insider', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suicides and Suicide Attempts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Traffic Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Traffic and Parking Violations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings, Downloads and Streaming', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Texas', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-23T18:52:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Marie Tae McDermott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Marie', 'middlename': 'Tae', 'lastname': 'McDermott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8b1712e5-4f08-5b96-8e96-d604a21a6b98', 'word_count': 844, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8b1712e5-4f08-5b96-8e96-d604a21a6b98'}, {'abstract': 'Exploring the world of local brews that feel as much a part of the region as its moors and old textile mills.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/26/travel/a-tasting-tour-of-yorkshires-beers-and-ales.html', 'snippet': 'Exploring the world of local brews that feel as much a part of the region as its moors and old textile mills.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The long hike across the West Yorkshire moors passed over hills peppered with scrubby grass, through fields of heather and over jagged rocks and gurgling streams. Along the way I’d been severely scolded by more than one chattering red grouse, and ignored by innumerable flocks of grazing sheep. Eventually I’d made it all the way to Top Withens, a ruined farmhouse whose setting was said to have been the inspiration for Emily Brontë’s “Wuthering Heights.” Sunburned and tired after the long walk, I needed refreshment.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/26/travel/26YORKSHIRE2/26YORKSHIRE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 434, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/26/travel/26YORKSHIRE2/26YORKSHIRE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 434}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/26/travel/26YORKSHIRE2/26YORKSHIRE2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 740, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/26/travel/26YORKSHIRE2/26YORKSHIRE2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1480, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/26/travel/26YORKSHIRE2/26YORKSHIRE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/26/travel/26YORKSHIRE2/26YORKSHIRE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'c