yt://article/80d1b1e4-091c-5f41-9e0b-c1878b54f290'}, {'abstract': 'Lacking Mr. Trump’s attention-generating celebrity, the other presidential candidates are working hard at traditional political events.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/24/us/politics/amid-the-donald-trump-show-republicans-hit-the-campaign-trail.html', 'snippet': 'Lacking Mr. Trump’s attention-generating celebrity, the other presidential candidates are working hard at traditional political events.', 'lead_paragraph': 'From their seats on the Senate Foreign Relations Committee, Marco Rubio and Rand Paul tried to score points for their presidential bids on Thursday by blasting Secretary of State John Kerry over the Iran nuclear deal. In New Hampshire, Jeb Bush and Gov. John R. Kasich fielded questions from voters at town hall-style meetings. Carly Fiorina hit four events over 10 hours in Iowa, while Gov. Scott Walker and Mike Huckabee spoke to conservative state lawmakers in California.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/24/us/24campaign-01/24campaign-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/24/us/24campaign-01/24campaign-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/24/us/24campaign-01/24campaign-01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/24/us/24campaign-01/24campaign-01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': 