ry details the life and career of Tucker, a hobnobbing 20th-century jazz singer known for her big voice.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/24/movies/review-the-outrageous-sophie-tucker-recalls-a-jazz-powerhouse.html', 'snippet': 'This documentary details the life and career of Tucker, a hobnobbing 20th-century jazz singer known for her big voice.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you close your eyes and randomly select a page from the autobiography of the singer Sophie Tucker, you may well end up reading a throwaway anecdote like this: “Queen Marie of Romania came to Chicago during our run there. We all hoped she would come to see the show, and an invitation was sent to Her Majesty. But she sent a gracious letter of apology, and we had to be content that night with Al Capone and a party of 20.” Flip a few more pages, and there’s this: “Will I ever forget the hamburger dinner I cooked for Fanny Brice and Aunt Jemima!” ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/24/arts/24OUTRAGEOUS1/24OUTRAGEOUS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 473, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/24/arts/24OUTRAGEOUS1/24OUTRAGEOUS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 473}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/24/arts/24OUTRAGEOUS1/24OUTRAGEOUS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 807, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/24/arts/24OUTRAGEOUS1/24OUTRAGEOUS1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1043, 'width': 1323, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images