s, they will be set by a third party. Sesac must also pay $3.6 million in legal costs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/24/business/media/sesac-settles-antitrust-lawsuit-over-royalty-rates.html', 'snippet': 'According to the deal, if Sesac cannot agree with the committee on fees, they will be set by a third party. Sesac must also pay $3.6 million in legal costs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The music licensing group Sesac has settled an antitrust lawsuit with the radio industry that will for the first time subject Sesac to arbitration over the royalty rates it charges stations.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sesac Settles Antitrust Lawsuit Over Royalty Rates', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Business Briefing; Sesac Settles Antitrust Lawsuit Over Royalty Fees for Stations', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sesac Inc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Antitrust Laws and Competition Issues', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Radio', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Royalties', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-23T22:52:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Sisario', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sisario', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f81c0bf5-352e-59a2-8ac4-cb9697296c14', 'word_count': 399, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f81c0bf5-352e-59a2-8ac4-cb9697296c14'}, {'abstract': 'Northeastern lawmakers expressed outrage at a provision in a bill that would postpone the deadline for railroads to install speed-curbing systems.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/24/us/senate-to-consider-delaying-rail-safety-mandate.html', 'snippet': 'Northeastern lawmakers expressed outrage at a provision in a bill that would postpone the deadline for railroads to install speed-curbing systems.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Two months after the high-speed derailment of an Amtrak train killed eight people and injured hundreds more in Philadelphia, a Senate transportation bill headed for debate this week calls for a three-year delay of the deadline for installing a rail safety system that experts say would have almost certainly prevented the Pennsylvania accident.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/24/us/24amtrakweb/24amtrakweb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 404, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/24/us/24amtrakweb/24amtrakweb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 404}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/24/us/24amtrakweb/24amtrakweb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 689, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/24/us/24amtrakweb/24amtrakweb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1379, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/24/us/24amtrakweb/24amtrakweb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/24/us/24amtrakweb/24amtrakweb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'r