1b58f25a3c7c'}, {'abstract': 'The restaurant Olio, named for the word meaning hodgepodge, draws inspiration from around the world.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/26/nyregion/restaurant-review-olio-in-stamford-offers-a-stew-of-global-ingredients.html', 'snippet': 'The restaurant Olio, named for the word meaning hodgepodge, draws inspiration from around the world.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Olio, on Hope Street in the Springdale section of Stamford, is hard to categorize. Its décor is Spanish, its chef and co-owner, Steve Costanzo, is Italian, and its menu is New American, with Asian and South American inflections. In a phone conversation with me after my visits, Mr. Costanzo explained that, after a long and diverse culinary career, which included stints at the now defunct restaurants Baang in Greenwich and Splash in Westport, he grew fond of matching flavors and cuisines.', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/26/nyregion/26DINECT1/26DINECT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/26/nyregion/26DINECT1/26DINECT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/26/nyregion/26DINECT1/26DINECT1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/26/nyregion/26DINECT1/26DINECT1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/26/nyregion/26DINECT1/26DINECT1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/26/nyregion/26DINECT1/26DINECT1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/26/nyregion/26DINECT1/26DINECT1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Restaurant Review: Olio in Stamford Offers a Stew of Global Ingredients', 'kicker': 'Dining | Stamford', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Stew of Global Ingredients', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Stamford (Conn)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Olio (Stamford, Conn, Restaurant)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-24T01:47:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patricia Brooks', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patricia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Brooks', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cc3777fc-042e-5855-b1d1-b515a83d2372', 'word_count': 568, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cc3777fc-042e-5855-b1d1-b515a83d2372'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Bessell presented five pieces, dancing and acting in a classical Indian tradition.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/24/arts/dance/review-in-the-art-of-abhinaya-bragha-bessell-dances-with-masterful-range.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Bessell presented five pieces, dancing and acting in a classical Indian tradition.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In many classical Indian dance traditions, the dancer is also an actor. A dance can be a kind of dramatic monologue in which the dancer presents a character, or several, and wordlessly tells a story, both narrating and re-enacting a poem. This kind of acting is called abhinaya, and it was the focus of a performance on Wednesday at the theater of Jacqueline Kennedy Onassis High School in Manhattan. Titled “The Art of Abhinaya,” this was the first solo recital in New York of the Bharatanatyam dancer Bragha Bessell, who revealed herself to be a master of the art.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/24/arts/24ABHINAYA/24ABHINAYA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 903, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/24/arts/24ABHINAYA/24ABHINAYA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 903}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/24/arts/24ABHINAYA/24ABHINAYA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 681, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/24/arts/24ABHINAYA/24ABHINAYA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1362, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/24/arts/24ABHINAYA/24ABHINAYA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/24/arts/24ABHINAYA/24ABHINAYA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/24/arts/24ABHINAYA/24ABHINAYA-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {