e': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}, {'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Blinder', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 3}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cf50a597-6707-5745-a57e-8b95c41738fd', 'word_count': 1677, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cf50a597-6707-5745-a57e-8b95c41738fd'}, {'abstract': 'The music video director Julien Temple aimed to recapture the luster and spectacle of old movie musicals with “Absolute Beginners” in 1986.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/26/movies/homevideo/absolute-beginners-evoking-mgm-spectacle-with-80s-video-style.html', 'snippet': 'The music video director Julien Temple aimed to recapture the luster and spectacle of old movie musicals with “Absolute Beginners” in 1986.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Most movies are made of scenes; others are devoted to making the scene. Julien Temple’s “Absolute Beginners” is one — a big-budget spectacle that, made in 1986, sought to render four decades of Anglo-American pop culture as a symphonic music video.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/26/arts/26HOBERMANJP/26HOBERMANJP-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 420, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/26/arts/26HOBERMANJP/26HOBERMANJP-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 420}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/26/arts/26HOBERMANJP/26HOBERMANJP-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 717, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/26/arts/26HOBERMANJP/26HOBERMANJP-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1434, 'wi