cestry and boundless aspiration, and as a songwriter who finds his complicated hometown both around and within himself.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — Something was not right. Wireless microphone in hand, Miguel was circling the floor of Club Nokia here during the soundcheck for a concert to preview his new album, “Wildheart.” It was one of the warm-up shows before Miguel’s first headlining tour, where he’ll be playing much larger clubs like Terminal 5 on August 2nd in New York City.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/26/arts/26MIGUEL/26MIGUEL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/26/arts/26MIGUEL/26MIGUEL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/26/arts/26MIGUEL/26MIGUEL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/26/arts/26MIGUEL/26MIGUEL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/26/arts/26MIGUEL/26MIGUEL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/26/arts/26MIGUEL/26MIGUEL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/26/arts/26MIGUEL/26MIGUEL-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'cr