ists took on the gendarmes at Pamplona Beach near here this weekend and lost. After four antinudist gendarmes in swimming trunks were hooted and booed off the beach by some 300 nudists — men, women and children — last week, the law returned in a speedboat and announced over loudspeakers: ‘‘Nudists, naturalists, this concerns you. … If the practice of naturalism and nudism is tolerated in certain places on French territory, the penal code formally forbids it in public. This is the last warning.’’', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1965: Nudists Get Under Police’s Skin', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nudism and Nudity', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-24T16:44:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8b265342-8409-5eec-984c-1a5d0672dccd', 'word_count': 160, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8b265342-8409-5eec-984c-1a5d0672dccd'}, {'abstract': 'Senator Ted Cruz, the sometimes-incendiary Texan running for the Republican presidential nomination, took to the Senate floor Friday to call his party’s majority leader a liar in an extraordinary public airing of grievance.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2015/07/24/ted-cruz-accuses-majority-leader-mitch-mcconnell-of-lying/', 'snippet': 'Senator Ted Cruz, the sometimes-incendiary Texan running for the Republican presidential nomination, took to the Senate floor Friday to call his party’s majority leader a liar in an extra