et': 'Anthem and Cigna are the latest health insurers to forge a deal, but they and their peers need to satisfy many regulators before pairing up.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Anthem and Cigna are the latest big American health insurers to propose a blockbuster merger. They and their peers need to satisfy many regulators, though, before the deals are approved. Here’s a look at the agencies and the deals that officials may be asked to swallow in an already concentrated industry.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Regulatory Hurdles to Health Insurance Mergers', 'kicker': 'Breakingviews', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Antitrust Laws and Competition Issues', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CIGNA Corporation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Anthem Inc.', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-24T19:23:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Cyran', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cyran', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/aad57a45-13d8-50a2-a1a4-9e370ad8e7a5', 'word_count': 848, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aad57a45-13d8-50a2-a1a4-9e370ad8e7a5'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Bessell presented five pieces, dancing and acting in a classical Indian tradition.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/25/arts/dance/review-in-the-art-of-abhinaya-bragha-bessell-dances-with-masterly-range.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Bessell presented five pieces, dancing and acting in a classical Indian tradition.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In many classical Indian dance traditions, the dancer is also an actor. A dance can be a kind of dramatic monologue in which the dancer presents a character, or several, and wordlessly tells a story, both narrating and re-enacting a poem. This kind of acting is called abhinaya, and it was the focus of a performance on Wednesday at the theater of Jacqueline Kennedy Onassis High School in Manhattan. Titled “The Art of Abhinaya,” this was the first solo recital in New York of the Bharatanatyam dancer Bragha Bessell, who revealed herself to be a master of the art.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/25/arts/25ABHINAYA/25ABHINAYA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 827, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/25/arts/25ABHINAYA/25ABHINAYA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 827}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/25/arts/25ABHINAYA/25ABHINAYA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 743, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/25/arts/25ABHINAYA/25ABHINAYA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1486, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/25/arts/25ABHINAYA/25ABHINAYA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/25/arts/25ABHINAYA/25ABHINAYA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None