eave victims with enormous bills.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Kathryn Varnum had just settled into her seat on the evening Amtrak train from Washington to New York after sending her parents an email. Her husband, Declan MacFarland, seated next to her, handed her an earbud. The couple, who were moving to a new apartment in Brooklyn that day, leaned back and listened to Madonna’s “Lucky Star.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/25/us/25AMTRAKWEB/25AMTRAKWEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/25/us/25AMTRAKWEB/25AMTRAKWEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/25/us/25AMTRAKWEB/25AMTRAKWEB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/25/us/25AMTRAKWEB/25AMTRAKWEB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/25/us/25AMTRAKWEB/25AMTRAKWEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/25/us/25AMTRAKWEB/25AMTRAKWEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/25/us/25AMTRAKWEB/25AMTRAKWEB-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Limit on Damages Is Squeezing Victims of Amtrak Wreck', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Limit on Damages Is Squeezing Victims of Amtrak Wreck ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Railroad Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMTRAK', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation (Civil)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Philadelphia (Pa)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-24T19:36:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ron Nixon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ron', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nixon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fe535a4d-0956-58a3-8cf6-8ef2c36bf036', 'word_count': 1070, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fe535a4d-0956-58a3-8cf6-8ef2c36bf036'}, {'abstract': 'The indictments come days before the State Department is expected to release an analysis of international efforts to fight such smuggling networks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/25/world/asia/thailand-charges-72-with-human-trafficking-crimes-ahead-of-us-report.html', 'snippet': 'The indictments come days before the State Department is expected to release an analysis of international efforts to fight such smuggling networks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BANGKOK — Prosecutors in Thailand indicted 72 people on Friday, accusing them of involvement in a multinational human trafficking syndicate. The indictments were filed three days before the expected release of an annual State Department report on human trafficking in countries around the world, including Thailand.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Thailand Charges 72 With Human Trafficking Crimes Ahead of U.S. Report', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'World Briefing | Asia; Thailand: Prosecutors Indict 72 on Human-Trafficking Charges', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Trafficking', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Thailand', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'State Department', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rohingya (Ethnic Group)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-24T19:39:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Poypiti Amatatham', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Poypiti', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Amatatham', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8892f663-cf08-59ba-a010-89db1b5dacca', 'word_count': 318, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8892f663-cf08-59ba-a010-89db1b5dacca'}, {'abstract': 'The husband-and-wife duo sang songs by Cy Coleman and Carolyn Leigh, and others.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/25/arts/music/review-eric-comstock-and-barbara-fasano-croon-at-the-metropolitan-room.html', 'snippet': 'The husband-and-wife duo sang songs by Cy Coleman and Carolyn Leigh, and others.', 'lead_paragraph': '“The poet laureates of the early ‘Mad Men’ era.” That apt description of the songwriting team Cy Coleman and Carolyn Leigh was one of many witty observational nuggets tossed out in Eric Comstock and Barbara Fasano’s playful show, “Shoulder Season,” on Thursday evening at the Metropolitan Room. The Coleman-Leigh standard “When in Rome (I Do as the Romans Do”), a mildly risqué celebration of marital infidelity while traveling, served as the prime example of how their songwriting pushed the boundaries of taste back in the late 1950s and early ’60s.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/25/arts/25COMSTOCK/25COMSTOCK-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 499, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/25/arts/25COMSTOCK/25COMSTOCK-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 499}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/25/arts/25COMSTOCK/25COMSTOCK-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 852, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/25/arts/25COMSTOCK/25COMSTOCK-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1704, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/25/arts/25COMSTOCK/25COMSTOCK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/25/arts/25COMSTOCK/25COMSTOCK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/25/arts/25COMSTOCK/25COMSTOCK-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: Eric Comstock and Barbara Fasano Croon at the Metropolitan Room', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Married for a While, Looking Back a Little Longer ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keyword