e crafts, and also a stage for musicians and performers. On July 20: A conversation in front of the Temple of Dendur at the Metropolitan Museum of Art about the China exhibit as well as a delightful conversation with Nicole Kidman about the costumes she wore in her films and how they helped her make the transformation into the characters she played. And on July 16, the Museum of Modern Art held a reception on the Cullman library terrace, with its spectacular view over the musuem’s sculpture gardens.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Arts of Living', 'kicker': 'Evening Hours', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Arts of Living', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Museums', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Rubin Museum of Art', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cunningham, Bill', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-24T20:34:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Cunningham', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cunningham', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d1c0d8e7-b015-5156-9a44-b3bde44d19c4', 'word_count': 148, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d1c0d8e7-b015-5156-9a44-b3bde44d19c4'}, {'abstract': 'Republican White House hopefuls campaign in Iowa and Texas, and the president visits Kenya amid schools, and backpacks, with his name on them.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2015/07/24/first-draft-focus-the-week-in-political-pictures-26/', 'snippet': 'Republican White House hopefuls campaign in Iowa and Texas, and the president visits Kenya amid schoo