th of the car-hailing service Uber, Melissa Mark-Viverito, the City Council speaker, delivered a searing rebuke to the mayor.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/25/nyregion/uber-deal-strains-ties-for-de-blasio-and-mark-viverito.html', 'snippet': 'After Mayor Bill de Blasio backed away from his vow to halt the growth of the car-hailing service Uber, Melissa Mark-Viverito, the City Council speaker, delivered a searing rebuke to the mayor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mayor Bill de Blasio and Melissa Mark-Viverito, the City Council speaker, were the closest of allies, a pair of ideological fellow travelers suddenly installed in two of New York’s most powerful jobs. Mr. de Blasio lobbied hard for Ms. Mark-Viverito’s election as speaker and was widely credited with propelling her to victory.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/25/nyregion/Y-DEBLASIO-1437777419568/Y-DEBLASIO-1437777419568-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/25/nyregion/Y-DEBLASIO-1437777419568/Y-DEBLASIO-1437777419568-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/25/nyregion/Y-DEBLASIO-1437777419568/Y-DEBLASIO-1437777419568-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/25/nyregion/Y-DEBLASIO-1437777419568/Y-DEBLASIO-1437777419568-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/25/nyregion/Y-DEBLA