7/25/world/middleeast/us-says-parole-of-jonathan-pollard-spy-for-israel-will-follow-law.html', 'snippet': 'The White House says relations with Israel will not influence the November release of Mr. Pollard, an American who was convicted of spying for Israel.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — United States officials said on Friday that they would not object to the scheduled parole of Jonathan J. Pollard, an American convicted of spying for Israel, who is eligible to be released in November after serving 30 years.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Says Parole of Jonathan Pollard, Spy for Israel, Will Follow Law', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Won’t Block November Parole for Israel Spy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Davis, Julie Hirschfeld', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Espionage and Intelligence Services', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pollard, Jonathan J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-25T01:13:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julie Hirschfeld Davis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julie', 'middlename': 'Hirschfeld', 'lastname': 'Davis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b85f7aba-9610-5adf-a2d9-2c8f6456ce64', 'word_count': 344, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b85f7aba-9610-5adf-a2d9-2c8f6456ce64'}, {'abstract': 'With each moment of Trumpian bravura — such as reading the cellphone number of Senator Lindsey Graham — news outlets must weigh whether it is worthy of a story. They most often decide yes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/25/business/media/donald-trumps-wealth-and-poll-numbers-complicate-news-medias-coverage.html', 'snippet': 'With each moment of Trumpian bravura — such as reading the cellphone number of Senator Lindsey Graham — news outlets must weigh whether it is worthy of a story. They most often decide yes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Since June 16, when Donald J. Trump announced his campaign for the Republican presidential nomination, his name has appeared in headlines of major newspapers an average of 22 times a day, according to the database Nexis, nearly three times as often as Jeb Bush, one of the perceived favorites.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/25/us/25TRUMPMEDIA/25TRUMPMEDIA-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/25/us/25TRUMPMEDIA/25TRUMPMEDIA-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/25/us/25TRUMPMEDIA/25TRUMPMEDIA-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/25/us/25TRUMPMEDIA/25TRUMPMEDIA-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/25/us/25TRUMPMEDIA/25TRUMPMEDIA-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/25/us/25TRUMPMEDIA/25TRUMPMEDIA-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/25/us/25TRUMPMEDIA/25TRUMPMEDIA-thumbLarge-v4.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Donald Trump’s Wealth and Poll Numbers Complicate News Media’s Coverage', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Trump&#8217;s Wealth and Early Poll Numbers Complicate News Media&#8217;s Coverage Decisions ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Somaiya, Ravi (Per)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Newspapers', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-25T01:22:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ravi Somaiya', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ravi', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Somaiya', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bbe2159d-aa24-559d-b708-3ec62bf846b9', 'word_count': 1077, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bbe2159d-aa24-559d-b708-3ec62bf846b9'}, {'abstract': 'A side benefit of being a Mets fan this year is that you become a specialist in the many ways a team can fail to hit.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/25/sports/baseball/next-thing-mets-hit-may-be-a-new-low.html', 'snippet': 'A side benefit of being a Mets fan this year is that you become a specialist in the many ways a team can fail to hit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sometime during the fifth inning of a game on a soft summer evening at Citi Field, our gaze strayed from our beers and sausages to the radiant green field and then to the scoreboard.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/25/sports/yPOWELL/yPOWELL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 782, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/25/sports/yPOWELL/yPOWELL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 782}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/25/sports/yPOWELL/yPOWELL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 787, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/25/sports/yPOWELL/yPOWELL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1573, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/25/sports/yPOWELL/yPOWELL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/25/sports/yPOWELL/yPOWELL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/25/sports/yPOWELL/yPOWELL-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Next Thing Mets Hit May Be a New Low ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Only Thing Mets May Hit: New Low ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Powell, Michael', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ALDERSON, SANDY', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-25T01:24:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Powell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Powell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/292689c3-52bd-50c2-ac9b-6b8adc5c7417', 'word_count': 1004, 'uri': 'nyt://article/292689c3-52bd-50c2-ac9b-6b8adc5c7417'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Gross, whose work was the subject of an Albert Maysles documentary, favored repeated movements drawn from daily life.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/26/arts/dance/sally-gross-choreographer-of-minimalist-dances-dies-at-81.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Gross, whose work was the subject of an Albert Maysles documentary, favored repeated movements drawn from daily life.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sally Gross, a leading avant-garde dancer and choreographer whose minimalist works helped propel the postmodern dance movement, died on Monday in Sag Harbor, N.Y. She was 81.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/26/arts/26gross-obit/26gross-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/26/arts/26gross-obit/26gross-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/26/arts/26gross-obit/26gross-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumb