 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/26/sports/baseball/mets-trade-for-braves-juan-uribe-and-kelly-johnson.html', 'snippet': 'When Dodgers second baseman Justin Turner, who used to play for the Mets, found out Juan Uribe was traded, he told some former teammates to expect an ebullient veteran who loves to laugh as much as he loves to win.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Juan Uribe greeted new teammates, laughed with old friends and hugged the former shortstop Nomar Garciaparra, a broadcaster. Uribe lounged comfortably in a chair in the Mets’ clubhouse and joked in Spanish with Ruben Tejada. He wore a bright red glove and a smile.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/26/sports/26mets-1/26mets-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 514, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/26/sports/26mets-1/26mets-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 514}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/26/sports/26mets-1/26mets-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 877, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/26/sports/26mets-1/26mets-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1753, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/26/sports/26mets-1/26mets-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/26/sports/26mets-1/26mets-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None