aithful and are willing to tell their spouse ahead of time.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/27/fashion/ethical-cheating-open-minded-dot-com.html', 'snippet': 'An online dating entrepreneur thinks an open mind is the ticket for those who plan to be unfaithful and are willing to tell their spouse ahead of time.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When the news broke recently that hackers had breached Ashley Madison, the dating website that helps married people find out-of-wedlock romance, the Internet responded with a lot of snark and not much sympathy.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/27/fashion/27WEBOPENMINDED1/27WEBOPENMINDED1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 321, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/27/fashion/27WEBOPENMINDED1/27WEBOPENMINDED1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 321}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/27/fashion/27WEBOPENMINDED1/27WEBOPENMINDED1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 548, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/27/fashion/27WEBOPENMINDED1/27WEBOPENMINDED1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1095, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/27/fashion/27WEBOPENMINDED1/27WEBOPENMINDED1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/27/fashion/27WEBOPENMINDED1/27WEBOPENMINDED1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/27/fashion/27WEBOPENMINDED1/27WEBOPENMINDED1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Is There Such a Thing as ‘Ethical Cheating’?', 'kicker': 'Water Cooler', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'He Presents the Case  for ‘Ethical Cheating’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'OpenMinded.com', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wade, Brandon (1960- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADULTERY', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dating and Relationships', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marriages', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Online Dating', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ashley Madison (Web Site)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ethics (Personal)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-26T12:07:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Katherine Rosman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Katherine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rosman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ef616012-9a86-598f-9768-c8cb5da56fc6', 'word_count': 571, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ef616012-9a86-598f-9768-c8cb5da56fc6'}, {'abstract': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Hungary’s aspirations to get Transylvania back are challenged in 1940.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/07/26/1940-hungary-expects-to-get-only-part-of-transylvania/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Hungary’s aspirations to get Transylvania back are challenged in 1940.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BUDAPEST — The impression that Soviet aspirations as yet unknown are the reason for this week-end’s Salzburg conversations is generally gaining ground here, as well as the feeling that Hungary will not receive the whole of Transylvania in the axis solution of the Danubian question, because of the important problem of erecting an anti-Russian bloc in this area. It is difficult to say how a partial cession of Transylvania would be received here, in view of the propaganda which has been waged for the return of the whole district. An indication of how this might be done gracefully, however, was given this morning in the ‘‘Pester Lloyd,’’ organ of the Foreign Office. The paper’s leading editorial resurrected the Hungarian claims for damages caused by the Rumanian Army during its partial occupation of the country in 1919. — New York Herald Tribune, July 27, 1940', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1940: Hungary Expects to Get Only Part of Transylvania', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World War II (1939-45)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Hungary', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Transylvania (Romania)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-26T13:09:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d19c2843-fd5f-5392-9e76-045d024d84c6', 'word_count': 144, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d19c2843-fd5f-5392-9e76-045d024d84c6'}, {'abstract': 'President Bashar al-Assad also said that the army had ceded some areas to insurgents in order to hold onto other regions deemed more important.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/27/world/middleeast/assad-in-rare-admission-says-syrias-army-lacks-manpower.html', 'snippet': 'President Bashar al-Assad also said that the army had ceded some areas to insurgents in order to hold onto other regions deemed more important.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIRUT, Lebanon — In a striking admission, President Bashar al-Assad of Syria said on Sunday that the country’s army faced a manpower shortage and had ceded some areas to insurgents in order to hold onto other regions deemed more important.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/27/world/sub-assad/sub-assad-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/27/world/sub-assad/sub-assad-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/27/world/sub-assad/sub-assad-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/27/world/sub-assad/sub-assad-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/27/world/sub-assad/sub-assad-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/27/world/sub-assad/sub-assad-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLa