7fc9369e-f13d-52df-9464-6bf9a7790fda'}, {'abstract': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Carmakers in the United States say they will begin introducing better seatbelt attachments, sun visors and other measures in 1965.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/07/26/1965-u-s-cars-to-provide-more-safety-features/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Carmakers in the United States say they will begin introducing better seatbelt attachments, sun visors and other measures in 1965.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW YORK — The nation’s leading auto makers now seem ready to install a number of safety items as mandatory equipment on their 1967 models. The decision to do so has not been taken lightly. Many of the auto makers, including Frederic G. Donner, chairman of General Motors, are known to feel that ‘‘if we were to force on people things they are not prepared to buy we would face a consumer revolt.’’', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/26/blogs/26iht-old1965/26iht-old1965-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 391, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/26/blogs/26iht-old1965/26iht-old1965-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 391}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/26/blogs/26iht-old1965/26iht-old1965-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 417, 'width': 640, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/26/blogs/26iht-old1965/26iht-old1965-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 417, 'width': 640, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/26/