ilkweed, rose mallows and cardinal flowers. Interspersed with lawns, the red and purple flora carpeted a new area of the park, which stretches for 1.3 miles along the East River. Until recently, Pier 6 near Atlantic Avenue had been largely barren. Now it evoked a Vermont meadow in midsummer.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/27/nyregion/27PARK1/27PARK1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 391, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/27/nyregion/27PARK1/27PARK1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 391}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/27/nyregion/27PARK1/27PARK1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 668, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/27/nyregion/27PARK1/27PARK1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1335, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/27/nyregion/27PARK1/27PARK1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/27/nyregion/27PARK1/27PARK1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/27/nyregion/27PARK1/27PARK1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Brooklyn Bridge Park Opening New Vistas', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Brooklyn Bridge Park Ope