ppet': 'In a perfect world, Kate Neckel would camp out on the High Line and install a swing on the underbelly of Washington Square Park’s marble arch.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Kate Neckel has never been bound by the traditional confines of canvas and paper. The artist has fashioned her signature intricate drawings of cityscapes and stylized figures on everything from the blank walls of the Ace Hotel to the bodies of her friends in the band Honduras. That interaction with her environment — and the people in it — has been at the core of Neckel’s creative output since she arrived in New York in 2000, fresh from grad school in Baltimore, and found herself in the enviable position of sharing an apartment with the model Angela Lindvall.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'An Artist Illustrates a Better Way to Enjoy Certain New York City Spaces', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'N.Y.C., Anew', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-27T16:00:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steve Dool', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steve', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dool', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/953b9676-0811-5280-bc40-37b8ffb9019b', 'word_count': 454, 'uri': 'nyt://article/953b9676-0811-5280-bc40-37b8ffb9019b'}, {'abstract': 'Wright-Phillips, a former Chelsea and England player, could join his brother Bradley in the Red Bulls’ lineup as soon as Saturday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/28/sports/soccer/red-bulls-sign-shaun-wright-phillips-the-brother-of-their-star-striker.html