2479c3a43e9', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/5de99bd6-1c39-59d8-b8c6-62479c3a43e9'}, {'abstract': 'One shop serves up a more casual, albeit diamond-encrusted, sensibility.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/07/27/lj-cross-upper-east-side/', 'snippet': 'One shop serves up a more casual, albeit diamond-encrusted, sensibility.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On New York’s Upper East Side, luxury is often less of a, well, luxury. It’s simply what’s for sale: Vintage lamps are sold beside Carolina Herrera gowns; Christian Louboutin shoes are a stone’s throw away from perfect peonies and Diptyque candles. But one newcomer boutique on Madison Avenue, LJ Cross, is serving up a different breed of luxury: one that’s a little less precious, and with a seaside sensibility that belies the shop’s zip code. It’s a rare sentiment for the neighborhood – which usually caters to a more buttoned-up sense of style — and comes courtesy of interior designer turned jewelry designer Lisa Jackson.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/27/t-magazine/27beddie-ljcross/27beddie-ljcross-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/27/t-magazine/27beddie-ljcross/27beddie-ljcross-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/27/t-magazine/27beddie-ljcross/27beddie-ljcross-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/27/t-magazine/27beddie-ljcross/27beddie-ljcross-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/27/t-magazine/27beddie-ljcross/27beddie-ljcross-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/27/t-magazine/27beddie-ljcross/27beddie-ljcross-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/27/t-magazine/27beddie-ljcross/27beddie-ljcross-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Upper East Side’s Beachiest Vibes', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Uptown Beach Town', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Upper East Side (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-27T19:40:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alainna Lexie Beddie', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alainna', 'middlename': 'Lexie', 'lastname': 'Beddie', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/46117340-9172-57dc-b807-c82a38a23f42', 'word_count': 331, 'uri': 'nyt://article/46117340-9172-57dc-b807-c82a38a23f42'}, {'abstract': 'Treatment can pose a daunting challenge for young women with body-image issues, and reawaken a previous problem.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/07/27/when-cancer-triggers-or-hides-an-eating-disorder/', 'snippet': 'Treatment can pose a daunting challenge for young women with body-image issues, and reawaken a previous problem.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As Kathleen Emmets was undergoing cancer treatment in New York over the past few years, her weight began to drop. Even though she was often nauseated and paralyzed by chemotherapy-induced neuropathy, she joked that thinness was the “bonus of cancer,” and found herself looking in the mirror and admiring her deep and hollow collarbone.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/28/science/28CANCER/28CANCER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 623, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/28/science/28CANCER/28CANCER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 623}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/28/science/28CANCER/28CANCER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 987, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/28/science/28CANCER/28CANCER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1974, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/28/science/28CANCER/28CANCER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/28/science/28CANCER/28CANCER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/28/science/28CANCER/28CANCER-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'When Cancer Triggers (or Hides) an Eating Disorder', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An Unexpected Side Effect', 'name': None, 'seo