ts over his career — a dream lover, a Spanish-language crooner and a New Pornographer. But the Dan Bejar who met T in the back of a Brooklyn bar one evening in early July has shed those guises in favor of something simpler: a guy who wants a cold beer before his flight back to Vancouver. “I have a very functional approach to booze,” says the 42-year-old musician as he sips his Dogfish Head Pilsner. “Which kind of disallows me from becoming a connoisseur.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/28/t-magazine/28symonds-bejar/28symonds-bejar-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 578, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/28/t-magazine/28symonds-bejar/28symonds-bejar-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 578}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/28/t-magazine/28symonds-bejar/28symonds-bejar-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 986, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/28/t-magazine/28symonds-bejar/28symonds-bejar-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1417, 'width': 1472, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/28/t-magazine/28symonds-bejar/28symonds-bejar-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/28/t-magazine/28symonds-bejar/28symonds-bejar-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/28/t-magazine/28symonds-bejar/28symonds-bejar-thumbLarge