cers and other security personnel in the north have surrendered to the militants in the campaign, and scores of others have retreated.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/29/world/asia/taliban-make-gains-across-3-provinces-in-afghanistan.html', 'snippet': 'Over 100 police officers and other security personnel in the north have surrendered to the militants in the campaign, and scores of others have retreated.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KABUL, Afghanistan — The Taliban have seized territory across three provinces in northern Afghanistan in recent days, as the government in Kabul has struggled to reinforce isolated outposts amid the insurgent offensive.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Taliban Make Gains Across 3 Provinces in Afghanistan', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Taliban Make Gains Across 3 Provinces in Afghanistan', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Taliban', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kunduz (Afghanistan)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-28T13:29:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joseph Goldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joseph', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Goldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/375a7f0d-1aa5-5873-8ca4-6408b243b6ab', 'word_count': 922, 'uri': 'nyt://article/375a7f0d-1aa5-5873-8ca4-6408b243b6ab'}, {'abstract': 'Readers had a range of reactions to the notion of young women planning their careers with an eye to accommodating breaks for the demands of family.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/29/upshot/readers-turn-hitting-pause-on-a-career.html', 'snippet': 'Readers had a range of reactions to the notion of young women planning their careers with an eye to accommodating breaks for the demands of family.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Educated millennial women seem to be taking a less linear approach to careers than women ahead of them did, as my article last week described. Young Harvard Business School graduates, for instance, were much more likely than older women to plan to interrupt their careers for family reasons. One reader called the approach “very sensible,” while another said it was “heartbreaking.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/29/upshot/29up-readercomments/29up-readercomments-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 357, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/29/upshot/29up-readercomments/29up-readercomments-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 357}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/29/upshot/29up-readercomments/29up-readercomments-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 608, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/29/upshot/29up-readercomments/29up-readercomments-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1217, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/29/upshot/29up-readercomments/29up-readercomments-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/29/upshot/29up-readercomments/29up-read