 '_id': 'nyt://article/1a425a23-379a-57ca-b2eb-65ebe9e72c40', 'word_count': 409, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1a425a23-379a-57ca-b2eb-65ebe9e72c40'}, {'abstract': 'A ceremony will take place in Auvers-sur-Oise, where van Gogh spent the last 70 days of his life and killed himself.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/07/28/visit-to-van-goghs-grave-part-of-events-for-125th-anniversary-of-his-death/', 'snippet': 'A ceremony will take place in Auvers-sur-Oise, where van Gogh spent the last 70 days of his life and killed himself.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AMSTERDAM — The great-grandnephew of Vincent van Gogh and other members of his family are among those planning to lay a wreath on van Gogh’s grave as part of the 125th anniversary commemoration of his death on Wednesday. The event will be part of an afternoon ceremony in Auvers-sur-Oise, the French village just northwest of Paris where van Gogh spent the last 70 days of his life and killed himself at age 37.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Visit to van Gogh’s Grave Part of Events for 125th Anniversary of His Death', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Wreath for van Gogh, From a Relative', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'van Gogh, Vincent', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AMSTERDAM (NETHERLANDS)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ARLES (FRANCE)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Auvers-sur-Oise (France)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Netherlands', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-28T16:46:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'n