oyed pepper-spray into a crowd in Cleveland has been placed on administrative duty until an investigation of the incident is completed, officials said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/28/us/cleveland-transit-officer-on-desk-duty-after-pepper-spray-was-used.html', 'snippet': 'A transit police sergeant who deployed pepper-spray into a crowd in Cleveland has been placed on administrative duty until an investigation of the incident is completed, officials said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A transit police sergeant who deployed pepper-spray into a crowd in Cleveland has been placed on administrative duty until an investigation of the incident is completed, officials at the Greater Cleveland Regional Transit Authority said Monday. Sgt. Robert Schwab, a 25-year-veteran, used the spray to push back a crowd that was blocking a police cruiser carrying an intoxicated 14-year-old boy, officials said. The incident, which was recorded on cellphone video by a bystander, occurred during a national conference at Cleveland State University that was intended to draw attention to police brutality and race relations.  ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ohio: Transit Officer on Desk Duty After Pepper Spray Was Used', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | Midwest', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Cleveland: Transit Officer on Desk Duty After Pepper Spray Was Used', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cleveland (Ohio)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schwab, Robert (Cleveland, OH, Police Officer)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-28T17:01:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ashley Southall', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ashley', 'middl