ot she would support the Keystone XL Pipeline project.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2015/07/28/hillary-clinton-is-stumped-on-question-of-keystone-pipeline/', 'snippet': 'The day after Hillary Rodham Clinton put forth a detailed plan for confronting climate change, she would not answer a question of whether or not she would support the Keystone XL Pipeline project.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NASHUA, N.H. — Hillary Rodham Clinton has an aggressive set of proposals to combat climate change. And she has a pipeline problem.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hillary Clinton Is Stumped on Question of Keystone Pipeline', 'kicker': 'First Draft', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Pipeline Stalls Clinton’s Environmental Momentum ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Environment', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Keystone Pipeline System', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Hillary Rodham', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AMHERST (MASS)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-28T18:01:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Politics', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Amy Chozick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Amy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Chozick', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/834ea7e1-08dc-5879-8762-afef3a021708', 'word_count': 604, 'uri': 'nyt://article/834ea7e1-08dc-5879-8762-afef3a021708'}, {'abstract': 'As the number of participants grow each week, so do our lists of winners. Congratulations to Ellen B for receiving the top honor, and to the 11 runners-up and 31 honorable mentions.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/07/28/summer-reading-contest-winner-week-5-pluto-and-planetary-exploration/', 'snippet': 'As the number of participants grow each week, so do our lists of winners. Congratulations to Ellen B for receiving the top honor, and to the 11 runners-up and 31 honorable mentions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Halfway through our Sixth Annual Summer Reading Contest, a few things have become clear. First, we’re on track to break previous records, since we’re now receiving 700 or more entries each week, and we suspect that, as school deadlines loom, we’ll get many hundreds beyond that each week in August. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Summer Reading Contest Winner, Week 5 | Pluto and Planetary Exploration', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2015-07-28T18:05:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Learning Network', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Learning Network'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/364cf2f9-983b-59fe-b3a7-df59dcf185dc', 'word_count': 683, 'uri': 'nyt://article/364cf2f9-983b-59fe-b3a7-df59dcf185dc'}, {'abstract': 'Hillary Rodham Clinton’s tax proposal focuses on short-term investors, but it slides over some important details about how people invest.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/29/business/dealbook/clintons-capital-gains-tax-change-misses-the-mark.html', 'snippet': 'Hillary Rodham Clinton’s tax proposal focuses on short-term investors, but it slides over some important details about how people invest.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hillary Rodham Clinton’s proposal to increase capital gains taxes for well-off individuals who hold investments for less than six years has a certain appeal. The plan is likely to raise effective tax rates on the top 1 percent of taxpayers, and some might wish to support it for that reason.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/28/business/db-standard-web3/db-standard-web3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/28/business/db-standard-web3/db-standard-web3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/28/business/db-standard-web3/db-standard-web3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/28/business/db-standard-web3/db-standard-web3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/28/business/db-standard-web3/db-standard-web3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/28/business/db-standard-web3/db-standard-web3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/28/business/db-standard-web3/db-standard-web3-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Hillary Clinton’s Capital Gains Tax Change Misses the Mark', 'kicker': 'Standard Deduction', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None,