999, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7cf268ce-57d7-5acf-b1df-0f2ecb0c5712'}, {'abstract': 'With some sleight of hand, Saturn peaches can look like doughnuts. A raspberry-lime sauce makes the dessert even prettier.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/29/dining/doughnut-saturn-peach-dessert.html', 'snippet': 'With some sleight of hand, Saturn peaches can look like doughnuts. A raspberry-lime sauce makes the dessert even prettier.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Finally, doughnuts in the “Recipes for Health” column! Mind you, they are pure fruit. I made them with Saturn peaches, those amusing flat peaches that look like the rings of Saturn (or like bagels; they are also known as doughnut peaches). The doughnuts are fun to work with and delicious, even if, admittedly, they are higher in sugar than what you might expect from me.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/29/dining/29MARTHA/29MARTHA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 395, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/29/dining/29MARTHA/29MARTHA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 395}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/29/dining/29MARTHA/29MARTHA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 674, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/29/dining/29MARTHA/29MARTHA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1347, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/29/dining/29MARTHA/29MARTHA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'le