nations for the Donald’s rise.', 'web_url': 'https://douthat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/07/28/the-meanings-of-trump/', 'snippet': 'Looking for explanations for the Donald’s rise.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Donald Trump spoke so, well, Trump-ishly about John McCain’s military service a little over week ago, it occurred to me that the entire trajectory of his campaign, a whole cycle of boom and bust, might be contained within the weeks I took off from\xa0my column, and that I could return to work and simply never mention him at all. And then even though I’m officially back at the grindstone\xa0now, I had a similar thought reading his lawyer’s very, well, Trump-ish rantings about marital rape and the Donald’s past yesterday … perhaps, I thought, the implosion would come before I could even finish up this post.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Meanings of Trump', 'kicker': 'Ross Douthat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Illegal Immigration', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tea Party Movement', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Third-Party Politics (US)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kaus, Mickey', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mailer, Norman', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Paul, Rand', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rubio, Marco', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iraq', 'rank': 13,