, 'snippet': 'Ms. Dunning, a centenarian who traveled around the country to car shows, died on May 17. In 2011, she was the subject of a New York Times video.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Margaret Dunning and her 1930 Packard 740 roadster were the darlings of car shows. The Packard was over 80 years old, noteworthy enough, but it was Ms. Dunning who, at over 100, charmed fellow car collectors and judges as the pair traveled across the country, making appearances and winning awards, including one at Pebble Beach in 2012 when she was 102.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Another Peek at Margaret Dunning and Her 1930 Packard', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Antique and Classic Cars', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Michigan', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dunning, Margaret (1910-2015)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-28T19:24:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'subsection_name': 'Collectible Cars', 'byline': {'original': 'By James Schembari', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schembari', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fd0addba-9d73-5a56-8ddb-c9e9ce6825d1', 'word_count': 255, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fd0addba-9d73-5a56-8ddb-c9e9ce6825d1'}, {'abstract': 'Joyce E. Mitchell, a former employee at the Clinton Correctional Facility in Dannemora, N.Y., pleaded guilty to charges that she helped two prisoners escape by smuggling tools into the facility.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/nyregion/100000003824291/prison-worker-pleads-guilty-in-court.html', 'snippet': 'Joyce 