'', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c5522839-3ddb-50de-a737-3ffe263d96fe', 'word_count': 425, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c5522839-3ddb-50de-a737-3ffe263d96fe'}, {'abstract': 'David Wright worked out at Citi Field for the first time in months, and the Mets formally welcomed reliever Tyler Clippard, but Mejia was suspended for 162 games after testing positive for steroids.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/29/sports/baseball/mets-jenrry-mejia-suspended-again-after-steroid-test.html', 'snippet': 'David Wright worked out at Citi Field for the first time in months, and the Mets formally welcomed reliever Tyler Clippard, but Mejia was suspended for 162 games after testing positive for steroids.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a day of gyrating emotions for the Mets, they watched their favorite son, David Wright, work out for the first time in months at Citi Field, formally welcomed a valuable new addition to the bullpen in Tyler Clippard and then, a short while later, found out that another late-inning reliever, Jenrry Mejia, had tested positive for the second time this season for a performance-enhancing substance and would now receive a 162-game suspension. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/29/us/29mets-1/29mets-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 455, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/29/us/29mets-1/29mets-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 455}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/29/us/29mets-1/29mets-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 777, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/29/us/29mets-1/29mets-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1555, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/29/us/29mets-1/29mets-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/29/us/29mets-1/29mets-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/29/us/29mets-1/29mets-1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Whirl of Emotions, Mets’ Mejia Is Barred\xa0and Wright Makes a Return', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In a Whirl of Emotions, Wright Makes a Return and Mejia Is Barred', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Berkman, Seth', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mejia, Jenrry', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wright, David', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doping (Sports)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-28T22:53:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Seth Berkman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Seth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Berkman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/97f3ea90-865d-58e8-9be2-288704aac8cb', 'word_count': 1117, 'uri': 'nyt://article/97f3ea90-865d-58e8-9be2-288704aac8cb'}, {'abstract': 'The documentary “Listen to Me Marlon,” directed by Stevan Riley, draws on audio recordings in which the actor talked about his life and career.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/29/movies/review-listen-to-me-marlon-explores-brandos-life-of-contention.html', 'snippet': 'The documentary “Listen to Me Marlon,” directed by Stevan Riley, draws on audio recordings in which the actor talked about his life and career.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Marlon Brando died in 2004 at 80, more than a few obituary writers decided he hadn’t been a contender, after all. For them, this brilliant actor had devolved into as much a loser as Terry Malloy, his punch-drunk boxer in “On the Waterfront,” who is sold down the river and, with a face battered by fights and the pain of a brother’s betrayal, famously eulogizes himself: “I coulda been a contender, I coulda been somebody, instead of a bum, which is what I am.” Those who dismissed Brando reviewed his life as if it were some kind of movie, one with a strong opening act, a bewildering middle and a disappointing conclusion deserving of a collective thumbs down. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/29/arts/29LISTEN/29LISTEN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 318, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/29/arts/29LISTEN/29LISTEN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 318}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/29/arts/29LISTEN/29LISTEN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 543, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/29/arts/29LISTEN/29LISTEN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'he