llphone and 10,000 text messages, the league said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Barely more than a week before the Super Bowl, he appeared at a news conference wearing a sweatshirt, slacks and a woolen Patriots hat, and a two-day growth of beard. He affected a soft, doe-eyed innocence. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/29/sports/Y-JP-POWELL/Y-JP-POWELL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 408, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/29/sports/Y-JP-POWELL/Y-JP-POWELL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 408}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/29/sports/Y-JP-POWELL/Y-JP-POWELL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 696, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/29/sports/Y-JP-POWELL/Y-JP-POWELL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1393, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/29/sports/Y-JP-POWELL/Y-JP-POWELL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/29/sports/Y-JP-POWELL/Y-JP-POWELL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/29/sports/Y-JP-POWELL/Y-JP-POWELL-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Tom Brady Hands Off the Dirty Work', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '