eir eligibility questioned.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/29/opinion/who-should-be-allowed-to-compete-as-a-female-athlete.html', 'snippet': 'Athletes who participate as females in junior competitions, and continue to do so at the senior level, should not have their eligibility questioned.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Should the size and shape of a woman’s breasts be considered factors in whether she is allowed to participate in elite athletic competitions like the Olympic Games? It sounds a bit ridiculous, but since 2011, breast size and shape have helped determine whether a woman may have testosterone levels deemed too high to be allowed to compete with other women.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/29/opinion/29pielkeWeb/29pielkeWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 393, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/29/opinion/29pielkeWeb/29pielkeWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 393}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/29/opinion/29pielkeWeb/29pielkeWeb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 671, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/29/opinion/29pielkeWeb/29pielkeWeb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1341, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/29/opinion/29pielkeWeb/29pielkeWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/29/opinion/29pielkeWeb/29pielkeWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank':