nced cast of Jessica Lange, Gabriel Byrne and John Gallagher, Jr.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Oscar-nominated actor Michael Shannon (“Revolutionary Road”) will return to Broadway next spring to play James Jr., the elder son of the troubled Tyrone family, in the Roundabout Theater’s revival of Eugene O’Neill’s “Long Day’s Journey Into Night,” the company announced on Wednesday. Mr. Shannon will join the previously announced cast of Jessica Lange and Gabriel Byrne as Mary and James Tyrone and John Gallagher Jr. as their younger son, Edmund. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/29/arts/29SHANNON/29SHANNON-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 756, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/29/arts/29SHANNON/29SHANNON-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 756}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/29/arts/29SHANNON/29SHANNON-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 813, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/29/arts/29SHANNON/29SHANNON-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1626, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/29/arts/29SHANNON/29SHANNON-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/29/arts/29SHANNON/29SHANNON-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/29/arts/29SHANNON/29SH