 service. The troops return to their quarters in command of officers loyal to the Government.’’ — The New York Herald, European Edition, July 30, 1890', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/30/blogs/30iht-oldjuly30-buenosaires/30iht-oldjuly30-buenosaires-jumbo.png', 'height': 531, 'width': 394, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/30/blogs/30iht-oldjuly30-buenosaires/30iht-oldjuly30-buenosaires-superJumbo.png', 'height': 531, 'width': 394, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/30/blogs/30iht-oldjuly30-buenosaires/30iht-oldjuly30-buenosaires-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/30/blogs/30iht-oldjuly30-buenosaires/30iht-oldjuly30-buenosaires-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/30/blogs/30iht-oldjuly30-buenosaires/30iht-oldjuly30-buenosaires-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1890: Argentine Rebellion Crushed', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-29T14:28:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/03e54bdb-1ad2-53ed-a7e8-800410aa5295', 'word_count': 110, 'uri': 'nyt://article/03e54bdb-1ad2-53ed-a7e8-800410aa5295'}, {'abstract': 'The opening of the Center of Ceramic Art in York, England, comes at a time of renewed public interest in the crafts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/30/arts/international/opening-of-ceramics-center-coincides-with-crafts-revival.html', 'snippet': 'The opening of the Center of Ceramic Art in York, England, comes at a time of renewed public interest in the crafts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'YORK, England — Perched on a shelf at York Art Gallery is a ceramic figure of a portly middle-aged man holding a magnifying glass. A new work by the ceramicist Peter Meanley, it depicts William Ismay, a librarian from the nearby city of Wakefield who devoted most of his spare time and money to collecting British studio pottery, which has been made by artisanal potters since the early 1900s.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/30/arts/international/30iht-ceramics30a/30iht-ceramics30a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 394, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/30/arts/international/30iht-ceramics30a/30iht-ceramics30a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 394}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/30/arts/international/30iht-ceramics30a/30iht-ceramics30a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 673, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/30/arts/international/30iht-ceramics30a/3