ccused of killing Mr. Dubose, who was unarmed, during a traffic stop on July 19.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A University of Cincinnati police officer was indicted Wednesday on a murder charge in what a prosecutor called “a senseless, asinine shooting” of an unarmed man during a minor traffic stop. Officials say it was the first time such a charge had been leveled against an officer in the county.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'University of Cincinnati Officer\xa0Indicted in Shooting Death of Samuel Dubose', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Officer Indicted in Shooting Death of Unarmed Man', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders, Attempted Murders and Homicides', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dubose, Samuel (1972-2015)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tensing, Ray (1989- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Cincinnati', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cincinnati (Ohio)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-29T17:11:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Pérez-Peña', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pérez-Peña', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3ad732ba-415d-5172-b68f-b0fa821f55d2', 'word_count': 1582, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3ad732ba-415d-5172-b68f-b0fa821f55d2'}, {'abstract': 'The surge in attacks, which were condemned by Iraq, was carried out on six Kurdish t