or survived life in the drug trade in the Whitman public housing complex in Brooklyn before getting a leading movie role.', 'lead_paragraph': 'James Grant strolled through the Walt Whitman Houses in Fort Greene, Brooklyn, recalling his past as a drug dealer while pointing out where he played football and where the police caught him with a Tec-9 pistol after a foot chase. Now, he said, he is planning on acting lessons and a life with fewer burdens than being a leader of the Bloods gang. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/30/arts/30FIVESTAR/30FIVESTAR-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/30/arts/30FIVESTAR/30FIVESTAR-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/30/arts/30FIVESTAR/30FIVESTAR-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/30/arts/30FIVESTAR/30FIVESTAR-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/30/arts/30FIVESTAR/30FIVESTAR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/30/arts/30FIVESTAR/30FIVESTAR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/30/arts/30FIVESTAR/30FIVESTAR-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'su