tin,” an interview from “The Tonight Show Starring Johnny Carson” in which Mr. Martin discusses “The Jerk.” Excerpts from the Film Institute ceremony follow at 8; “Father of the Bride” (1991), about a doting patriarch who finds his life upended and bank account depleted when his daughter announces that she’s getting married, at 9:30; and “Pennies From Heaven” (1981), in which the dreams of a sheet-music salesman who longs to live in a world like the one depicted in the songs he peddles lead to tragedy, at 1 a.m.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s on TV Thursday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What&#8217;s On TV Thursday', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-30T05:00:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kathryn Shattuck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kathryn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shattuck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/ef33a261-b70c-5df8-bead-45e073553aef', 'word_count': 676, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ef33a261-b70c-5df8-bead-45e073553aef'}, {'abstract': 'Philadelphia, which sent Jonathan Papelbon to Washington on Tuesday, will acquire five prospects and the left-hander Matt Harrison, according to an official with knowledge of the talks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/30/sports/baseball/phillies-said-to-be-trading-cole-hamels-to-rangers.html', 'snippet': 'Philadelphia, which sent Jonathan Papelbon to Washington on Tuesday, will acquire five prospects and the left-hander Matt Harrison, according to an official with knowledge of the talks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When the Philadelphia Phillies signed Cole Hamels to a six-year contract extension, in 2012, they believed he could help extend their long run of success. Instead, after five consecutive division titles, the Phillies collapsed. On Wednesday, they succumbed to their new reality.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Phillies Said to Be Trading Cole Hamels to Rangers', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Phillies Said to Be Trading Cole Hamels to Rangers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Trades (Sports)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Texas Rangers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hamels, Cole', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Philadelphia Phillies', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Harrison, Matt (1985- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-30T05:22:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tyler Kepner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tyler', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kepner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8a9355b6-8ada-53ed-b961-89ac03a8f612', 'word_count': 369, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8a9355b6-8ada-53ed-b961-89ac03a8f612'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the Day for Thursday, July 30, 2015.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/30/pageoneplus/quotation-of-the-day.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the Day for Thursday, July 30, 2015.', 'lead_paragraph': '“People don’t get shot for a traffic stop.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': 