22-906a-5ad9-948e-696342535d0a'}, {'abstract': 'Margaretta Barton Colt’s self-published book details the 27-year life of the Military Bookman, a specialty antiquarian shop she and her husband ran on the Upper East Side.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/31/books/review-martial-bliss-a-loving-memoir-about-a-bookstore-for-military-buffs.html', 'snippet': 'Margaretta Barton Colt’s self-published book details the 27-year life of the Military Bookman, a specialty antiquarian shop she and her husband ran on the Upper East Side.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The story Margaretta Barton Colt has to tell in her charming memoir, “Martial Bliss” — do not misread its title as “Marital Bliss” — takes place only a few decades ago. But it seems to emerge as if from a time machine.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/31/arts/31BOOK/31BOOK-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 903, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/31/arts/31BOOK/31BOOK-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 903}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/31/arts/31BOOK/31BOOK-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 681, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/31/arts/31BOOK/31BOOK-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1361, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/31/arts/31BOOK/31BOOK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/31/arts/31BOOK/31BOOK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/31/arts/31BOOK/31BOOK-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: ‘Martial Bliss,’ a Loving Memoir About a Bookstore for Military Buffs', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Marshaling an Army of Military Memories', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Colt, Margaretta Barton', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Martial Bliss: The Story of The Military Bookman (Book)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-30T17:59:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Books', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dwight Garner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dwight', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Garner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/6aae3083-ad94-5894-8df4-55fda8061049', 'word_count': 1079, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6aae3083-ad94-5894-8df4-55fda8061049'}, {'abstract': 'Plus: a dividing survey issue; vaccines and a new baby; and flight boarding by group.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/02/fashion/even-a-near-slur-demands-an-apology.html', 'snippet': 'Plus: a dividing survey issue; vaccines and a new baby; and flight boarding by group.', 'lead_paragraph': 'During a PTA meeting, a colleague said, “You can chew them down on the price.” I had never heard this expression, but another colleague explained to me that it was probably a misuse of the horrible phrase “Jew them down.” I have a feeling the speaker didn’t know this. As president of the PTA, I would like to e