rosoft&#8217;s Punishing Math Lesson', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Microsoft Corp', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nokia Oyj', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Windows (Operating System)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smartphones', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nadella, Satya', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-30T20:50:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By James B. Stewart', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b9f2246f-9b86-5e26-981e-f6ad1a261617', 'word_count': 1224, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b9f2246f-9b86-5e26-981e-f6ad1a261617'}, {'abstract': 'For the fifth “Mission: Impossible” movie, Mr. Cruise is joined by, among others, Jeremy Renner, Ving Rhames, Simon Pegg and Rebecca Ferguson.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/31/movies/review-mission-impossible-rogue-nation-with-tom-cruise-and-plenty-of-stunts.html', 'snippet': 'For the fifth “Mission: Impossible” movie, Mr. Cruise is joined by, among others, Jeremy Renner, Ving Rhames, Simon Pegg and Rebecca Ferguson.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Watching Tom Cruise hurtle through the latest “Mission: Impossible,” taking one blow after another, you can’t help worrying that he won’t be able to keep this action stuff up. It looks so hard! But here he is, the 53-year-old Tom Terrific, holding onto a plane as it takes off, defying sense and gravity, and making you wonder (not for the first time) if he would actually die for our pleasure. By the time he’s flailing underwater without an oxygen tank, struggling against violent surges as breath and time run out, you can almost feel the life leaving his body. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/31/arts/31MISSION/31MISSION-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 931, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/31/arts/31MISSION/31MISSION-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 931}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/31/arts/31MISSION/31MISSION-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 660, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/31/arts/31MISSION/31MISSION-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1320, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/31/arts/31MISSION/31MISSION-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/31/arts/31MISSION/31MISSION-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/31/arts/31MISSION/31MISSION-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: ‘Mission: Impossible — Rogue Nation’ With Tom Cruise and Plenty of Stunts', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Your Next Stunt, Should You Choose to Accept It', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McQuarrie, Christopher', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cruise, Tom', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pegg, Simon', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rhames, Ving', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Renner, Jeremy', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de Palma, Brian', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Mission: Impossible - Rogue Nation (Movie)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-30T20:59:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Manohla Dargis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Manohla', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dargis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/205fc946-7336-5d1f-9a0b-dec7ae00f1d2', 'word_count': 897, 'uri': 'nyt://article/205fc946-7336-5d1f-9a0b-dec7ae00f1d2'}, {'abstract': 'The architect Thomas Heatherwick’s designs dazzle, but their costs have stirred debate over the role of private financing for public spaces.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/02/arts/design/the-price-of-thomas-heatherwicks-imagination.html', 'snippet': 'The architect Thomas Heatherwick’s designs dazzle, but their costs have stirred debate over the role of private financing for public spaces.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A tiny canal bridge in London doesn’t just open for boat traffic, it curls up like a caterpillar. A suave redesign of London’s familiar double-decker bus invites passengers to the upper deck with a curving ribbon window that follows a winding staircase. An exposition building in Shanghai is covered in what look like porcupine quills. A pier in the Hudson is reimagined as a miniature island park with an amphitheater nestled within Lilliputian hills.', 'print_sect