{'abstract': 'Thousands lined up in Rameswaram, India, for a glimpse of former President A.P.J. Abdul Kalam’s coffin, many of them having traveled since he died on Monday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/31/world/asia/from-hundreds-of-miles-away-indians-converge-to-remember-abdul-kalam.html', 'snippet': 'Thousands lined up in Rameswaram, India, for a glimpse of former President A.P.J. Abdul Kalam’s coffin, many of them having traveled since he died on Monday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'RAMESWARAM, India — At the break of dawn, Nimmi Jaan sat down on a patch of red sand near a large tent that had been set up the night before. She was one of the first people there. By afternoon, a line would stretch out behind her, across a sun-scorched field, through a patch of palms, around a bend and out of sight.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/31/world/31Kalam1-web/31Kalam1-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 390, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/31/world/31Kalam1-web/31Kalam1-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 390}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/31/world/31Kalam1-web/31Kalam1-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 665, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/31/world/31Kalam1-web/31Kalam1-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1331, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/31/world/31Kalam1-web/31Kalam1-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'cro