n in second-quarter profits and assured investors that its recent record-setting penalty for safety violations would not slow its earnings momentum.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Fiat Chrysler Profit Increases 69%, Most of It From North America ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fiat Chrysler Profit Increases 69%, Most of It From North America ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fiat Chrysler Automobiles NV', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Company Reports', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Marchionne, Sergio', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fines (Penalties)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recalls and Bans of Products', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-31T00:19:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Vlasic', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vlasic', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0348dda6-87a0-58d2-8855-652b6690a4cc', 'word_count': 573, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0348dda6-87a0-58d2-8855-652b6690a4cc'}, {'abstract': 'This documentary from Robert Gordon and Morgan Neville mines the Buckley-Vidal skirmishes around the 1968 political conventions for nuggets of historical insight.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/31/movies/review-best-of-enemies-recalls-gore-vidal-and-william-f-buckley-jrs-tv-battles.html', 'snippet': 'This documentary from Robert Gordon and Morgan Neville mines the Buckley-Vidal skirmishes around the 1968 political conventions for nuggets of historical insight.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In 1968, as the summer political-convention season approached, ABC News decided to take a gamble. The network seemed permanently stuck in third place, and its news division in particular suffered from the lack of a brand-name on-air authority figure to compete with Chet Huntley and David Brinkley at NBC or Walter Cronkite at CBS. Back in those days, the two leading networks covered the conventions live from beginning to end. (Can you imagine?) Instead of comprehensiveness, ABC went for provocation and at least the illusion of intellectual heft, hiring Gore Vidal and William F. Buckley Jr. to conduct a series of debates during the Republican circus in Miami and the subsequent Democratic debacle in Chicago. “Best of Enemies,” Robert Gordon and Morgan Neville’s lively new documentary, an accessible assemblage of archival footage and talking-head analysis, mines the Buckley-Vidal skirmishes for nuggets of historical insight.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/31/arts/31BENEMIES/31BENEMIES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/31/arts/31BENEMIES/31BENEMIES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 480}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/31/arts/31BENEMIES/31BENEMIES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/31/arts/31BENEMIES/31BENEMIES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1639, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/31/arts/31BENEMIES/31BENEMIES-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'h