 'There is widespread agreement that shelters like the one housing a man who fought a Washington Heights restaurant owner are wrong for mentally ill people, but there are now more shelters and less supportive housing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/31/nyregion/problems-of-housing-mentally-ill-people-spill-into-the-street.html', 'snippet': 'There is widespread agreement that shelters like the one housing a man who fought a Washington Heights restaurant owner are wrong for mentally ill people, but there are now more shelters and less supportive housing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One evening last week, a restaurant owner in Washington Heights and two customers stood chatting on the sidewalk about the changes in the area over the last 25 years. The restaurateur, Peter Walsh, was telling the people, who were coming from a hospital on 168th Street, how much safer the neighborhood had become as he stood in front of his restaurant, Coogan’s, on Broadway between 168th and 169th Streets. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/31/nyregion/31ABOUT/31ABOUT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/31/nyregion/31ABOUT/31ABOUT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/31/nyregion/31ABOUT/31ABOUT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/31/nyregion/31ABOUT/31ABOUT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit'