nd bigotry.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/07/31/movies/review-jennys-wedding-a-lecture-on-tolerance.html', 'snippet': 'This movie, directed by Mary Agnes Donoghue and starring Katherine Heigl as a closeted lesbian, is about secrets, lies and bigotry.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Jenny’s Wedding” begins with a christening and ends with a conga line — a finale signaled so clearly that even those in the cheap seats can’t miss it. And that’s one of the many irritants in this trite, well-intentioned lecture on tolerance: The audience is always several moves ahead of the script.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/31/arts/31JENNYSWEDDING/31JENNYSWEDDING-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 254, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/31/arts/31JENNYSWEDDING/31JENNYSWEDDING-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 254}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/31/arts/31JENNYSWEDDING/31JENNYSWEDDING-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 433, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/31/arts/31JENNYSWEDDING/31JENNYSWEDDING-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 866, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/31/arts/31JENNYSWEDDING/31JENNYSWEDDING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/07/31/arts/31JENNYSWEDDING/31JENNYSWEDDING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge',