 to Make Room for Death', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cemeteries', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Funerals and Memorials', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gangs', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Organized Crime', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'El Salvador', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Guatemala City (Guatemala)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Honduras', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-31T07:00:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Gonzalez', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gonzalez', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9f4f0cd3-72cb-511f-ad9b-8b3c0d64cc62', 'word_count': 810, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9f4f0cd3-72cb-511f-ad9b-8b3c0d64cc62'}, {'abstract': 'On the night of July 11, the police in Guangzhou came for the human rights lawyer Ge Wenxiu. They threatened to break down his door.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/world/asia/100000003829775/a-nighttime-police-visit-in-china.html', 'snippet': 'On the night of July 11, the police in Guangzhou came for the human rights lawyer Ge Wenxiu. They threatened to break down his door.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On the night of July 11, the police in Guangzhou came for the human rights lawyer Ge Wenxiu. They threatened to break down his door.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/31/multimedia/china-lawyer-ar