donymous novel, about a woman who learns her fiancé was an impostor, on the experience of their dying friend, Katherine Russell Rich.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Editors’ Choice', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Editors’ Choice | Recent Books of Particular Interest', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-31T15:34:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'BookReview', 'section_name': 'Books', 'subsection_name': 'Book Review', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/025bf072-8aa5-52c7-92b7-3dc9df1fe20b', 'word_count': 266, 'uri': 'nyt://article/025bf072-8aa5-52c7-92b7-3dc9df1fe20b'}, {'abstract': 'Plus, YSL “Couture,” Cindy Crawford’s series and more from the week in style.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/07/31/alexander-wang-balenciaga-birkin-cara-delevingne-style-news/', 'snippet': 'Plus, YSL “Couture,” Cindy Crawford’s series and more from the week in style.', 'lead_paragraph': 'All the week’s fashion news that’s fit to reprint.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/31/t-magazine/31chic-moss/31chic-moss-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 314, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/07/31/t-magazine/31chic-moss/31chic-moss-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 314}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/07/31/t-magazine/31chic-moss/31chic-moss-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 536, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption'