stract': 'Financial advice is normally geared toward traditional families, but single-parent, same-sex or multigenerational households may gain from tailored advice.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/01/your-money/modern-families-and-modern-money-worries.html', 'snippet': 'Financial advice is normally geared toward traditional families, but single-parent, same-sex or multigenerational households may gain from tailored advice.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WHEN it comes to their families, the rich have a lot in common with the rest of us.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/01/business/01wealth-web/01wealth-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/01/business/01wealth-web/01wealth-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/01/business/01wealth-web/01wealth-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/01/business/01wealth-web/01wealth-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/01/business/01wealth-web/01wealth-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/01/business/01wealth-web/01wealth-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/01/business/01wealth-web/01wealth-web-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Modern Families and Modern Money Worries', 'kicker': 'Wealth Matters', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Modern Families and Modern Money Worries', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Families and Family Life', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'High Net Worth Individuals', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Financial Planners', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Personal Finances', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-31T15:43:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Sullivan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sullivan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b14eee04-7869-5109-8aa6-2094fcb84d3b', 'word_count': 1406, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b14eee04-7869-5109-8aa6-2094fcb84d3b'}, {'abstract': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Germany torpedoes the Leyland liner Iberian in 1915.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/07/31/1915-submarine-sinks-the-iberian/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Germany torpedoes the Leyland liner Iberian in 1915.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Sixty-one survivors of the Leyland liner Iberian, which after being attacked by shellfire, was torpedoed and sunk by a German submarine yesterday afternoon, were landed at a British port to-day. It was then learned that seven of her crew, three of whom were Americans, and one American woman, Miss Mary Wily, of Boston, had been killed by the pirates’ shellfire. The crew got into the ship’s boats and rowed about for several hours before being rescued by a British steamer. Two of the crew died on board the rescuing steamer. The Iberian had a gross tonnage of 5,223, and was built at Sunderland in 1900. Only a month ago the Armenian of the same line was torpedoed and sunk off the Scillies. She, too, was shelled as a preliminary, and a number of men were killed, among them being sixteen Americans. Six more Lowestoft trawlers, the Coriander, Fitzgerald, Quest, Athena, Achieve and Strive were torpedoed and sunk by submarines to-day. Nearly all of the crew were saved. — The New York Herald, European Edition, August 1, 1915', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1915: Submarine Sinks the Iberian', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'GERMANY', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Submarines and Submersibles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World War I (1914-18)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-31T15:44:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ed68f666-e373-5f45-9f6f-95e27850f923', 'word_count': 179, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ed68f666-e373-5f45-9f6f-95e27850f923'}, {'abstract': 'On a day when temperatures climbed into the mid-90s, Central Park patrons stayed cool with ice cream and a dip of their feet in the lake.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/nyregion/100000003827441/melting-in-central-park.html', 'snippet': 'On a day when temperatures climbed into the mid-90s, Central Park patr