 Hollywood from a singularly skewed point of view, that of an insider still dazzled by the star-spangled myth. ', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/02/nyregion/02ARTSCT1/02ARTSCT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 381, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/02/nyregion/02ARTSCT1/02ARTSCT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 381}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/02/nyregion/02ARTSCT1/02ARTSCT1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 651, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/02/nyregion/02ARTSCT1/02ARTSCT1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1302, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/02/nyregion/02ARTSCT1/02ARTSCT1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/08/02/nyregion/02ARTSCT1/02ARTSCT1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/02/nyregion/02ARTSCT1/02ARTSCT1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: ‘I’ll Eat You Last’ in Hartford Portrays Sue Mengers', 'kicker': 'Theater | Hartford', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Behind-the-Scenes Star Surrounded by Talent', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 