}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Teenagers and Adolescence', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gupta, Vanita', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-07-31T19:21:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Pérez-Peña', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pérez-Peña', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/80466d64-3ebc-5d9e-b25e-038c6c2e2755', 'word_count': 1131, 'uri': 'nyt://article/80466d64-3ebc-5d9e-b25e-038c6c2e2755'}, {'abstract': 'Several African-American motorists conducting business at the Department of Motor Vehicle offices in New York this week watched Ms. Bland’s video and saw, in her, someone like themselves.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/08/01/nyregion/for-some-drivers-video-of-sandra-blands-arrest-is-all-too-familiar.html', 'snippet': 'Several African-American motorists conducting business at the Department of Motor Vehicle offices in New York this week watched Ms. Bland’s video and saw, in her, someone like themselves.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Rocheane Mabatano is a clerical associate at Queens Hospital Center who lives in Rosedale and has never been to Texas. But the jarring sensation of been-there familiarity she felt when she saw the video of Sandra Bland’s traffic stop was still with her days later.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/08/01/nyregion/01CRIMESCENEweb/01CRIMESCENEweb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 903, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/08/01/nyregion/01CRIMESCENEweb/01CRIMESCENEweb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 903}}, {'rank':